{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DGRx2HKpbajP7bnXGrPJiV","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'Claim 1从''31% instability''降调为''20-28% after conservative controls''——permutation\n2\t  null 5.2%虽仍显著但审稿人 质疑temporal label携带非DIF信号(cohort composition shift, training data\n3\t  vintage correlation)。RL robustness 降级为limitation (N=13, Jaccard=0.75, inconclusive)。Claim\n4\t  2 meta-critique需补充ConStat/Min-K%在 web-overlap labels上的具体failure case analysis。Claim\n5\t  3 semi-synthetic framework升级为primary contribution (ΔTPR=0.42 at p=0.5，cross-subject\n6\t  ΔFPR<0.001稳健)。整体定位从''discovery paper''调整为 ''methodological contribution (semi-synthetic\n7\t  framework) + empirical case study (temporal DIF on MMLU)''。 增加explicit discussion\n8\t  ''IRT model misspecification bounds''，pilot bifactor on 2-3 subjects。 8页压缩勉强可行但GSM1K\n9\t  exploratory和circularity ablation细节移入appendix。reviewer avg 3.0-3.5, novelty score\n10\t  2.5-3.5, 需major revision后accept。\n11\t\n12\t  '\n13\timagined_experiments:\n14\t- name: real_data_dif_mmlu\n15\t  plan_id: plan_001\n16\t  description: '对METABENCH MMLU响应矩阵(5219×12508)运行MH-DIF。temporal cohort (2023 vs 2024-H1)、\n17\t    ability quintile、within-family confound control、domain-specificity分析。\n18\t\n19\t    '\n20\t  expected_results:\n21\t    temporal_ets_c_pct: 31.3\n22\t    temporal_fpr_li_clean: 0.32\n23\t    temporal_enrichment: 0.96\n24\t    ability_ets_c_pct: 2.9\n25\t    ability_enrichment: 1.19\n26\t    within_family_llama2v3_c_pct: 61.3\n27\t    within_family_mistral_mixtral_c_pct: 38.7\n28\t    domain_spearman_rho: 0.31\n29\t    domain_spearman_p: 0.02\n30\t    sanity_random_split_c_pct: 0.18\n31\t    effective_c_pct_after_all_controls: 24.5\n32\t    domain_specificity_range: 20.7-48.4%\n33\t    unweighted_mean_c_pct: 30.6\n34\t  result_rationale: 'Raw C%=31.3%与实际一致——这是MH-DIF在该数据上的机械输出，不受tier影响。median档的关键区别在于\n35\t    downstream interpretation：permutation null将揭示3-8%的baseline（plan_029），ability matching\n36\t    扣除2.4pp（plan_027），combined controls将effective estimate压至~24.5%。enrichment≈1.0仍成立\n37\t    因为Li et al. labels本质上测量的是global exposure而非differential contamination——这个null result是结构性的，与tier无关。domain\n38\t    correlation ρ=0.31 (p=0.02)在subject level是modest ecological correlation，item-level\n39\t    decomposition（plan_019/030）将显示domain improvement仅解释≤2.4pp。 within-family Llama-2v3的61.3%反映了巨大的ability\n40\t    gap (d=-0.99)，ability matching后降至~28%， 与temporal cohort matched estimate收敛——这支持~24-29%是genuine\n41\t    item-level DIF的估计。 median档下审稿人会argue 24.5%虽显著但不如31.3%那么striking，且temporal label可能携带\n42\t    training data vintage以外的confound（e.g., RLHF protocol evolution, tokenizer changes）。\n43\t\n44\t    '\n45\t  tables:\n46\t  - name: 'Table 1: Temporal DIF Summary (Median Tier Interpretation)'\n47\t    columns:\n48\t    - cohort_definition\n49\t    - n_ref\n50\t    - n_foc\n51\t    - raw_c_pct\n52\t    - permutation_null_c_pct\n53\t    - ability_adjusted_c_pct\n54\t    - effective_c_pct\n55\t    rows:\n56\t    - - temporal_2023v2024\n57\t      - 1080\n58\t      - 807\n59\t      - 31.3\n60\t      - 5.2\n61\t      - 28.9\n62\t      - 24.5\n63\t    - - ability_quintile\n64\t      - 2100\n65\t      - 2100\n66\t      - 2.9\n67\t      - 0.3\n68\t      - —\n69\t      - 2.6\n70\t    - - random_split_sanity\n71\t      - 950\n72\t      - 950\n73\t      - 0.18\n74\t      - —\n75\t      - —\n76\t      - ~0\n77\t  - name: 'Table 2: Within-Family Confound Control'\n78\t    columns:\n79\t    - family_pair\n80\t    - raw_c_pct\n81\t    - cohens_d\n82\t    - ability_matched_c_pct\n83\t    - interpretation\n84\t    rows:\n85\t    - - Llama-2_vs_Llama-3\n86\t      - 61.3\n87\t      - -0.99\n88\t      - 28.3\n89\t      - ability confound explains 33pp\n90\t    - - Mistral_vs_Mixtral\n91\t      - 38.7\n92\t      - -0.45\n93\t      - ~30\n94\t      - moderate ability confound\n95\t    - - Temporal_2023v2024\n96\t      - 31.3\n97\t      - -0.17\n98\t      - 28.9\n99\t      - ability confound explains 2.4pp\n100\t  figures_description:\n101\t  - 'Fig 1: C% by MMLU subject (57 bars), horizontal line at permutation null mean=5.2%.\n102\t    All subjects above null, range 20.7-48.4%. Shaded band shows effective range 20-28%\n103\t    after controls.'\n104\t  - 'Fig 2: Scatter plot domain accuracy improvement vs subject C%, ρ=0.31. Annotation:\n105\t    item-level R²<0.001.'\n106\t  analysis: 'Raw 31.3%数据不变，但median档的叙事必须承认：(1) permutation null 5.2%意味着temporal label\n107\t    本身携带约5pp的非DIF信号；(2) ability matching扣除2.4pp；(3) 合计conservative estimate为 ~24.5%。审稿人会要求明确报告effective\n108\t    C%而非仅raw C%。仍然是substantial finding （24.5% >> random 0.18%），但从\"approximately 31%\"降调为\"20-28%\n109\t    after conservative controls\"。 domain correlation ρ=0.31虽p<0.05但explanatory power极低（R²<0.001\n110\t    at item level）， 支持instability is item-specific而非domain-driven的结论。\n111\t\n112\t    '\n113\t- name: rl_robustness_validation\n114\t  plan_id: plan_002\n115\t  description: '验证DIF对RL训练的鲁棒性。SFT baseline + alignment-RL (DPO/ORPO, N=477) + reasoning-RL\n116\t    (GRPO/PPO, N=13)。对比DIF vs ConStat vs Min-K%在各cohort上的表现。\n117\t\n118\t    '\n119\t  expected_results:\n120\t    n_reasoning_rl_models: 13\n121\t    n_alignment_rl_models: 477\n122\t    n_sft_baseline: 350\n123\t    dif_flag_jaccard_sft_vs_sft_plus_alignment_rl: 0.92\n124\t    dif_flag_jaccard_sft_vs_sft_plus_reasoning_rl: 0.75\n125\t    dif_flag_jaccard_sft_vs_all_combined: 0.78\n126\t    bootstrap_jaccard_ci_reasoning_rl:\n127\t    - 0.62\n128\t    - 0.87\n129\t    constat_auroc_sft: 0.72\n130\t    constat_auroc_alignment_rl: 0.68\n131\t    constat_auroc_reasoning_rl: 0.58\n132\t    mink_auroc_sft: 0.75\n133\t    mink_auroc_reasoning_rl: 0.62\n134\t    dif_c_pct_sft_only_cohort: 30.8\n135\t    dif_c_pct_with_reasoning_rl: 28.2\n136\t    auroc_drop_constat_sft_to_rl: 0.14\n137\t    auroc_drop_mink_sft_to_rl: 0.13\n138\t    tost_equivalence_p: 0.18\n139\t    delong_dif_vs_constat_p: 0.34\n140\t    power_analysis_partial_exploitation:\n141\t      p_04_detection_boundary_delta: 1.8\n142\t      p_06_detection_boundary_delta: 1.5\n143\t      p_08_detection_boundary_delta: 1.3\n144\t      p_10_detection_boundary_delta: 1.0\n145\t  result_rationale: 'N=13 reasoning-RL模型是median档的核心瓶颈。alignment-RL (DPO/ORPO)不产生NLL\n146\t    gap contraction， 因此Jaccard=0.92与SFT几乎无差异——这不是RL-robustness的有效测试。真正的测试是reasoning-RL\n147\t    (GRPO/PPO)，但N=13意味着：(1) 将13个模型加入focal cohort（N=807→820）对群体级DIF统计量 影响微弱，Jaccard=0.75反映的是sampling\n148\t    variability而非systematic degradation；(2) Bootstrap CI [0.62, 0.87]跨越了\"moderate\n149\t    shift\"和\"essentially stable\"的分界线；(3) TOST equivalence test p=0.18无法reject non-equivalence，即无法正式claim\n150\t    equivalence。traditional detectors (ConStat, Min-K%) 在reasoning-RL上AUROC下降0.13-0.14，但N=13的individual-level比较power极低，CI覆盖null。\n151\t    结论：DIF flags shift moderate但方向不确定，无法claim RL-robust也无法claim RL-breaks-DIF。 必须降级为limitation：\"RL\n152\t    robustness remains an open question due to insufficient reasoning-RL sample size\"。partial\n153\t    exploitation power analysis是clean theoretical result但缺乏empirical validation。\n154\t\n155\t    '\n156\t  tables:\n157\t  - name: 'Table: RL Robustness Summary'\n158\t    columns:\n159\t    - cohort_composition\n160\t    - n_total_foc\n161\t    - dif_c_pct\n162\t    - jaccard_vs_baseline\n163\t    - constat_auroc\n164\t    - mink_auroc\n165\t    rows:\n166\t    - - SFT_only\n167\t      - 350\n168\t      - 30.8\n169\t      - 1.0\n170\t      - 0.72\n171\t      - 0.75\n172\t    - - SFT+alignment_RL\n173\t      - 827\n174\t      - 31.0\n175\t      - 0.92\n176\t      - 0.68\n177\t      - 0.71\n178\t    - - SFT+reasoning_RL\n179\t      - 363\n180\t      - 28.2\n181\t      - 0.75\n182\t      - 0.58\n183\t      - 0.62\n184\t    - - All_combined\n185\t      - 840\n186\t      - 29.5\n187\t      - 0.78\n188\t      - 0.65\n189\t      - 0.67\n190\t  figures_description:\n191\t  - 'Fig: Jaccard stability as function of reasoning-RL fraction in focal cohort.\n192\t    Bootstrap CIs shown. Dashed line at Jaccard=0.80 (stability threshold). CI crosses\n193\t    threshold at N_RL≈10.'\n194\t  analysis: 'median档下RL robustness是最弱的claim。Jaccard=0.75在0.65-0.85范围内，审稿人会正确指出： (1)\n195\t    N=13不足以区分genuine degradation和sampling noise；(2) alignment-RL的high Jaccard不证明 RL-robustness因为DPO不是target\n196\t    mechanism；(3) TOST failure意味着equivalence未被证明。 唯一可写的是\"DIF shows moderate stability\n197\t    when reasoning-RL models are added to the cohort, but the small sample precludes\n198\t    definitive conclusions\"——这作为limitation而非robustness evidence。\n199\t\n200\t    '\n201\t- name: constat_perturbation_eval\n202\t  plan_id: plan_003a\n203\t  description: '独立评估ConStat-style perturbation testing在MMLU上的表现。LLM paraphrasing生成语义等价\n204\t    reformulations，比较原始与改写性能差异。\n205\t\n206\t    '\n207\t  expected_results:\n208\t    n_items_paraphrased: 220\n209\t    paraphrase_semantic_similarity_mean: 0.91\n210\t    paraphrase_quality_human_rating: 3.8\n211\t    constat_detection_auroc_all_models: 0.63\n212\t    constat_detection_auroc_non_rl: 0.67\n213\t    constat_detection_auroc_rl_models: 0.51\n214\t    fdr_controlled_suspicious_pct: 14.2\n215\t    constat_dif_overlap_jaccard: 0.13\n216\t    constat_dif_overlap_phi: 0.08\n217\t    constat_fpr_at_05_threshold: 0.11\n218\t    constat_tpr_at_05_threshold: 0.38\n219\t    web_overlap_label_concordance: 0.22\n220\t  result_rationale: 'ConStat检测verbatim contamination via performance drop on paraphrased\n221\t    items。在median档下： (1) paraphrasing quality足够（similarity=0.91）但不完美——部分reformulation可能改变了cognitive\n222\t    demand而非仅surface form，引入noise；(2) non-RL models AUROC=0.67是moderate但not strong，因为\n223\t    MMLU的4-choice format天然限制了performance variance（25% floor）；(3) RL models AUROC≈0.51\n224\t    接近chance，验证了Wang et al.的concern——reasoning-RL models不依赖verbatim memorization；\n225\t    (4) ConStat-DIF overlap极低（Jaccard=0.13）因为两种方法测量不同construct：ConStat测量 individual\n226\t    model对specific item的memorization，DIF测量cohort-level differential functioning。 这个低overlap支持Claim\n227\t    2的meta-critique但审稿人会质疑：如果两种方法如此不同，是否说明 DIF并非测量contamination而是测量something else\n228\t    entirely？median档下这个tension无法完全resolve。\n229\t\n230\t    '\n231\t  tables:\n232\t  - name: 'Table: ConStat Detection by Model Category'\n233\t    columns:\n234\t    - model_category\n235\t    - n_models\n236\t    - auroc\n237\t    - fdr_q05_flags_pct\n238\t    - overlap_dif_jaccard\n239\t    rows:\n240\t    - - SFT_only\n241\t      - 15\n242\t      - 0.67\n243\t      - 16.3\n244\t      - 0.14\n245\t    - - alignment_RL\n246\t      - 12\n247\t      - 0.64\n248\t      - 13.8\n249\t      - 0.12\n250\t    - - reasoning_RL\n251\t      - 8\n252\t      - 0.51\n253\t      - 8.1\n254\t      - 0.09\n255\t    - - all\n256\t      - 35\n257\t      - 0.63\n258\t      - 14.2\n259\t      - 0.13\n260\t  figures_description:\n261\t  - 'Fig: Venn diagram of DIF-C flags vs ConStat suspicious items vs Li et al. web-overlap\n262\t    positives. Triple overlap < 5%.'\n263\t  analysis: 'ConStat结果支持\"不同检测方法测量不同contamination constructs\"的叙事，但median档下的AUROC 偏低，审稿人可能质疑paraphrasing\n264\t    methodology。作为Claim 2的empirical scaffolding有用但不够strong。 降级为appendix baseline comparison。\n265\t\n266\t    '\n267\t- name: dvd_generation_variance_eval\n268\t  plan_id: plan_003b\n269\t  description: '在MMLU上独立评估DVD generation variance检测。对10-15个开源模型生成多次responses， 计算variance\n270\t    scores，检测bimodal distributions。\n271\t\n272\t    '\n273\t  expected_results:\n274\t    n_models_tested: 12\n275\t    n_responses_per_item: 50\n276\t    temperature: 0.8\n277\t    bimodal_items_pct: 7.8\n278\t    bimodal_dif_overlap_jaccard: 0.11\n279\t    generation_variance_contamination_auroc: 0.58\n280\t    variant_contamination_detection_auroc: 0.55\n281\t    verbatim_contamination_detection_auroc: 0.62\n282\t    signal_to_noise_ratio: 1.3\n283\t    temperature_sensitivity_auroc_range:\n284\t    - 0.52\n285\t    - 0.64\n286\t  result_rationale: 'DVD依赖generation variance作为contamination signal：contaminated items应有lower\n287\t    variance （模型确定性更高）。在median档下：(1) MMLU是4-choice MCQ，generation variance本质上是 logit\n288\t    variance over 4 options——信号空间极窄；(2) 7.8% bimodal items远低于DIF的31.3%， 且overlap极低（Jaccard=0.11），说明DVD捕获的是不同phenomenon（可能是item\n289\t    ambiguity 而非contamination）；(3) AUROC=0.58仅略高于chance，signal-to-noise=1.3不足以作为 reliable\n290\t    detector；(4) temperature sensitivity range [0.52, 0.64]说明结果对hyperparameter fragile。在median档下DVD\n291\t    essentially fails as a standalone detector on MCQ benchmarks。 这支持ensemble的motivation但也限制了ensemble的ceiling。\n292\t\n293\t    '\n294\t  tables:\n295\t  - name: 'Table: DVD Detection Performance'\n296\t    columns:\n297\t    - contamination_type\n298\t    - auroc\n299\t    - bimodal_pct\n300\t    - snr\n301\t    rows:\n302\t    - - verbatim\n303\t      - 0.62\n304\t      - 9.2\n305\t      - 1.5\n306\t    - - variant\n307\t      - 0.55\n308\t      - 6.1\n309\t      - 1.1\n310\t    - - overall\n311\t      - 0.58\n312\t      - 7.8\n313\t      - 1.3\n314\t  figures_description:\n315\t  - 'Fig: Generation variance distribution for DIF-C vs non-DIF items. Largely overlapping,\n316\t    weak separation.'\n317\t  analysis: 'DVD在MCQ benchmarks上表现差是expected——4选1格式的generation variance信号极弱。 在median档下这成为negative\n318\t    result，进一步支持Claim 2的论点：现有per-model detectors 各有structural limitations。但negative\n319\t    result本身不够novel，移入appendix。\n320\t\n321\t    '\n322\t- name: ensemble_fusion\n323\t  plan_id: plan_003c\n324\t  description: '融合DIF + ConStat + DVD为multi-signal ensemble。2-of-3 majority voting和weighted\n325\t    fusion。\n326\t\n327\t    '\n328\t  expected_results:\n329\t    ensemble_auroc_majority_vote: 0.66\n330\t    ensemble_auroc_weighted: 0.69\n331\t    ensemble_fpr_at_05: 0.13\n332\t    ensemble_coverage_theoretical: DIF≥1.4, ConStat≥0.6, DVD variant\n333\t    ensemble_improvement_over_best_individual: 0.02\n334\t    cross_validation_weight_variance: 0.18\n335\t    uniform_weight_auroc: 0.65\n336\t    optimized_weight_auroc: 0.69\n337\t    overfitting_gap: 0.04\n338\t  result_rationale: 'Ensemble ceiling受限于weakest components。在median档下：(1) DVD AUROC≈0.58几乎是noise，\n339\t    实际上是2-signal ensemble (DIF+ConStat) with DVD as dead weight；(2) weighted fusion\n340\t    仅比best individual (DIF) 提升+0.02，且cross-validation显示weight variance=0.18—— 说明optimal\n341\t    weights unstable across folds，overfitting gap=0.04；(3) majority voting AUROC=0.66略低于weighted因为DVD的noise票拉低了precision；(4)\n342\t    FPR=0.13勉强满足<0.15 但不satisfying。整体来看ensemble contribution marginal，不足以作为standalone\n343\t    contribution。 在median档下ensemble被correctly dropped from main claims（与Dream #6 consensus一致）。\n344\t\n345\t    '\n346\t  tables:\n347\t  - name: 'Table: Ensemble Performance Comparison'\n348\t    columns:\n349\t    - method\n350\t    - auroc\n351\t    - fpr\n352\t    - tpr_at_fpr_10\n353\t    rows:\n354\t    - - DIF_only\n355\t      - 0.67\n356\t      - 0.31\n357\t      - 0.52\n358\t    - - ConStat_only\n359\t      - 0.63\n360\t      - 0.11\n361\t      - 0.38\n362\t    - - DVD_only\n363\t      - 0.58\n364\t      - 0.15\n365\t      - 0.28\n366\t    - - Majority_vote\n367\t      - 0.66\n368\t      - 0.13\n369\t      - 0.45\n370\t    - - Weighted_fusion\n371\t      - 0.69\n372\t      - 0.12\n373\t      - 0.49\n374\t  figures_description:\n375\t  - 'Fig: ROC curves for individual detectors and ensemble methods. Ensemble marginal\n376\t    improvement visible only in mid-FPR range.'\n377\t  analysis: 'Ensemble不提供sufficient added value。correctly dropped from contributions。\n378\t    在appendix作为\"we tried this, marginal improvement\"的completeness disclosure。 审稿人不会要求ensemble作为contribution，但会appreciate\n379\t    transparency。\n380\t\n381\t    '\n382\t- name: cross_benchmark_gsm8k\n383\t  plan_id: plan_004\n384\t  description: '在GSM8K (1319 items × 6702 models)上复制DIF分析。GSM1K作为contamination ground\n385\t    truth。 Semi-synthetic validation。\n386\t\n387\t    '\n388\t  expected_results:\n389\t    gsm8k_temporal_c_pct: 15.2\n390\t    gsm8k_sanity_c_pct: 0.25\n391\t    gsm8k_standard_external_spearman: 0.91\n392\t    semi_synthetic_delta_tpr_p05: 0.42\n393\t    semi_synthetic_delta_tpr_p10: 0.68\n394\t    semi_synthetic_standard_delta_tpr_p10: 0.72\n395\t    gsm1k_correlation_n: 33\n396\t    gsm1k_pearson_r: -0.35\n397\t    gsm1k_pearson_p: 0.045\n398\t    gsm1k_spearman_rho: -0.3\n399\t    gsm1k_spearman_p: 0.09\n400\t    gsm1k_pearson_ci_95:\n401\t    - -0.62\n402\t    - -0.02\n403\t    partial_r_controlling_accuracy: -0.28\n404\t    partial_p: 0.11\n405\t    leave_one_out_r_range:\n406\t    - -0.45\n407\t    - -0.22\n408\t  result_rationale: 'median档下GSM8K C%=15.2%（在cross_benchmark_c_pct_min range 12-18%内），低于MMLU的31.3%。\n409\t    这反映GSM8K的structural特点：(1) 单一domain (math)意味着DIF更多反映capability improvement 而非item-specific\n410\t    instability；(2) 1319 items远少于MMLU的12508，statistical power lower。 semi-synthetic\n411\t    ΔTPR=0.42 at p=0.5（在0.35-0.50 range内），低于actual的0.834(standard)和 0.517(external)——median档预期cross-subject\n412\t    matching在single-domain benchmark上效率较低， 因为\"other subjects\"不存在于GSM8K，只能用external\n413\t    ability measures。GSM1K correlation在 median档下weakened：r=-0.35 (vs actual -0.478)，N=33使得CI极宽[-0.62,\n414\t    -0.02]，Spearman p=0.09不显著。partial correlation controlling accuracy p=0.11也不显著。审稿人会argue这\n415\t    不够strong作为validation evidence——correctly demoted to exploratory。方向仍是NEGATIVE (opposite\n416\t    to contamination hypothesis)，这对叙事是complicating factor。\n417\t\n418\t    '\n419\t  tables:\n420\t  - name: 'Table: GSM8K Temporal DIF'\n421\t    columns:\n422\t    - metric\n423\t    - value\n424\t    - ci_95_lower\n425\t    - ci_95_upper\n426\t    rows:\n427\t    - - temporal_c_pct\n428\t      - 15.2\n429\t      - 12.8\n430\t      - 17.9\n431\t    - - semi_synthetic_delta_tpr_p05\n432\t      - 0.42\n433\t      - 0.31\n434\t      - 0.54\n435\t    - - gsm1k_pearson_r\n436\t      - -0.35\n437\t      - -0.62\n438\t      - -0.02\n439\t    - - gsm1k_spearman_rho\n440\t      - -0.3\n441\t      - -0.59\n442\t      - 0.05\n443\t  figures_description:\n444\t  - 'Fig: GSM8K DIF-C fraction vs GSM1K contamination gap scatter (N=33). Negative\n445\t    trend with wide CI band. Deepseek-math-7b-rl as outlier annotated.'\n446\t  analysis: 'GSM8K replication confirms framework portability但signal weaker。C%=15.2%在single-domain\n447\t    benchmark上reasonable。GSM1K correlation direction puzzling (NEGATIVE)且median档下\n448\t    barely significant——demoted to exploratory appendix。semi-synthetic ΔTPR=0.42 is\n449\t    the strongest deliverable: confirms detection power on independent benchmark。\n450\t\n451\t    '\n452\t- name: bifactor_irt_equating_pilot\n453\t  plan_id: plan_005\n454\t  description: '在MMLU上pilot bifactor IRT model (general + 57 subject-specific factors)。\n455\t    选择anchor items，fixed-parameter calibration equating。\n456\t\n457\t    '\n458\t  expected_results:\n459\t    convergence: false\n460\t    full_model_attempted: true\n461\t    n_subjects: 57\n462\t    convergence_failure_reason: 57 group factors + 12508 items exceeds estimation\n463\t      capacity\n464\t    subset_5_subjects_converged: true\n465\t    subset_5_bifactor_rmsea: 0.038\n466\t    subset_5_cfi: 0.89\n467\t    subset_5_general_factor_variance_explained: 0.42\n468\t    subset_5_specific_factor_variance_explained: 0.31\n469\t    subset_5_residual: 0.27\n470\t    target_cfi: 0.95\n471\t    target_met: false\n472\t    equating_pilot_rho: 0.91\n473\t    equating_pilot_target: 0.95\n474\t    equating_pilot_met: false\n475\t  result_rationale: 'median档下bifactor model在full MMLU上不收敛——57个subject-specific factors\n476\t    × 12508 items 的参数空间对于mirt estimation来说太大（即使用EM或MHRM）。5-subject subset收敛但fit below\n477\t    target：CFI=0.89 < 0.95 target，说明即使bifactor也不能adequately capture MMLU的 multidimensional\n478\t    structure。general factor仅解释42% variance意味着subject-specific factors 和residual各占约30%——MMLU确实是highly\n479\t    multidimensional。equating pilot在这些suboptimal parameters下达到ρ=0.91，低于0.95 target。结论：bifactor\n480\t    approach technically infeasible at scale且fit insufficient——killed as in actual\n481\t    registry。但median档下这个negative result 被一个审稿人视为重要：要求至少报告2-3 subject的pilot MIRT analysis来bound\n482\t    IRT misspecification对DIF findings的影响。这成为revision要求。\n483\t\n484\t    '\n485\t  tables:\n486\t  - name: 'Table: Bifactor Pilot on 5-Subject Subset'\n487\t    columns:\n488\t    - metric\n489\t    - observed\n490\t    - target\n491\t    - met\n492\t    rows:\n493\t    - - RMSEA\n494\t      - 0.038\n495\t      - <0.05\n496\t      - true\n497\t    - - CFI\n498\t      - 0.89\n499\t      - '>0.95'\n500\t      - false\n501\t    - - TLI\n502\t      - 0.86\n503\t      - '>0.95'\n504\t      - false\n505\t    - - general_variance_pct\n506\t      - 42\n507\t      - '>60'\n508\t      - false\n509\t    - - equating_rho\n510\t      - 0.91\n511\t      - '>0.95'\n512\t      - false\n513\t  figures_description:\n514\t  - 'Fig: Bifactor path diagram for 5-subject subset showing general + specific factor\n515\t    loadings. Substantial specific factor variance visible.'\n516\t  analysis: 'Bifactor killed但negative result有价值：quantifies IRT misspecification severity。\n517\t    median档下审稿人要求至少pilot 2-3 subject的MIRT作为revision补充实验，to show that DIF findings在multidimensional\n518\t    framework下方向一致（即使magnitude可能change）。 这是major revision的核心要求之一。\n519\t\n520\t    '\n521\t- name: item_generation_calibration\n522\t  plan_id: plan_006\n523\t  description: '为DIF-flagged items生成replacement items。LLM generation + student simulation\n524\t    calibration。\n525\t\n526\t    '\n527\t  expected_results:\n528\t    n_items_generated: 150\n529\t    difficulty_correlation_prompt_based: 0.32\n530\t    difficulty_correlation_student_sim: 0.48\n531\t    target_difficulty_correlation: 0.75\n532\t    target_met: false\n533\t    cognitive_level_match_pct: 62\n534\t    subject_match_pct: 100\n535\t    holdout_panel_validation_rho: 0.41\n536\t    generation_quality_human_rating: 3.2\n537\t  result_rationale: 'item generation在median档下below benchmarks。prompt-based difficulty\n538\t    targeting ρ=0.32 与literature一致（arXiv 2602.06631报告0.10-0.45）。student simulation\n539\t    calibration提升到 ρ=0.48但仍远低于0.75 target——原因：(1) MMLU items涵盖57个specialized domains，LLM生成\n540\t    在specialized knowledge items上quality不稳定；(2) student simulation (arXiv 2601.09953)\n541\t    的r=0.75-0.82是在其own benchmark上的，transfer到MMLU-style items有gap；(3) cognitive level\n542\t    matching仅62%说明生成的items常常shift了cognitive demand（e.g., 从recall变成reasoning）。 结论：item\n543\t    generation pipeline尚不mature enough for equating——correctly dropped from main claims。这与bifactor\n544\t    failure combined意味着Claim 3 (regeneration/equating) is dead。\n545\t\n546\t    '\n547\t  tables:\n548\t  - name: 'Table: Item Generation Quality'\n549\t    columns:\n550\t    - calibration_method\n551\t    - difficulty_rho\n552\t    - cognitive_match_pct\n553\t    - overall_quality\n554\t    rows:\n555\t    - - prompt_only\n556\t      - 0.32\n557\t      - 58\n558\t      - 2.8\n559\t    - - student_simulation\n560\t      - 0.48\n561\t      - 62\n562\t      - 3.2\n563\t    - - target\n564\t      - 0.75\n565\t      - 80\n566\t      - 4.0\n567\t  figures_description:\n568\t  - 'Fig: Scatter of generated item difficulty vs target difficulty. Wide dispersion,\n569\t    ρ=0.48.'\n570\t  analysis: 'Item generation correctly killed。不作为contribution。但作为appendix supplementary\n571\t    对future work有reference value。\n572\t\n573\t    '\n574\t- name: cumulative_bayesian_dif\n575\t  plan_id: plan_007\n576\t  description: '实现cumulative Bayesian DIF priors (Sinharay et al. 2006)。模拟4次successive\n577\t    benchmark administrations，展示累积evidence的power improvement。\n578\t\n579\t    '\n580\t  expected_results:\n581\t    single_admin_power_medium: 0.4\n582\t    cumulative_2_admin_power: 0.48\n583\t    cumulative_3_admin_power: 0.55\n584\t    cumulative_4_admin_power: 0.61\n585\t    target_3_admin_power: 0.7\n586\t    target_met: false\n587\t    delta_10_effect:\n588\t      single: 0.4\n589\t      cumulative_3: 0.55\n590\t    delta_14_effect:\n591\t      single: 0.68\n592\t      cumulative_3: 0.82\n593\t    false_positive_rate_cumulative: 0.058\n594\t    prior_specification: N(0, sigma=1.5)\n595\t  result_rationale: 'median档下cumulative power at 3 administrations仅达0.55（target 0.70）。差距原因：\n596\t    (1) simulation使用的是idealized independent administrations，但real temporal cohorts\n597\t    have correlated composition（overlapping models between administrations）；(2) medium\n598\t    effect size (δ=1.0) 在MMLU的high-noise环境下需要更多accumulation；(3) prior specification\n599\t    N(0,1.5)可能too vague for the specific DIF magnitude distribution observed in MMLU。对于large\n600\t    effects (δ≥1.4)，cumulative确实提升到0.82——但这些items 已经被single-admin MH-DIF以0.68 power检测到，marginal\n601\t    value limited。结论：theoretically sound但实际improvement insufficient to justify methodological\n602\t    complexity。simulation-only， underdeveloped，correctly moved to appendix。\n603\t\n604\t    '\n605\t  tables:\n606\t  - name: 'Table: Cumulative Bayesian Power by Effect Size'\n607\t    columns:\n608\t    - effect_delta\n609\t    - admin_1\n610\t    - admin_2\n611\t    - admin_3\n612\t    - admin_4\n613\t    rows:\n614\t    - - 0.8\n615\t      - 0.22\n616\t      - 0.3\n617\t      - 0.36\n618\t      - 0.41\n619\t    - - 1.0\n620\t      - 0.4\n621\t      - 0.48\n622\t      - 0.55\n623\t      - 0.61\n624\t    - - 1.4\n625\t      - 0.68\n626\t      - 0.75\n627\t      - 0.82\n628\t      - 0.87\n629\t    - - 1.6\n630\t      - 0.79\n631\t      - 0.85\n632\t      - 0.9\n633\t      - 0.93\n634\t  figures_description:\n635\t  - 'Fig: Power curves for single vs cumulative (2,3,4) administrations as function\n636\t    of effect size. Horizontal line at 0.70 target.'\n637\t  analysis: 'Cumulative Bayesian DIF在median档下是\"promising but insufficient\"的结果。 对medium\n638\t    effects改善不够，对large effects marginal。Appendix supplementary。 审稿人不会miss this——not\n639\t    a required contribution。\n640\t\n641\t    '\n642\t- name: graceful_degradation_analysis\n643\t  plan_id: plan_008\n644\t  description: '正式分析benchmark validity在progressive item replacement下的degradation。\n645\t    5%, 10%, 20%, 50% replacement rates。\n646\t\n647\t    '\n648\t  expected_results:\n649\t    rho_5pct_replacement: 0.9991\n650\t    rho_10pct_replacement: 0.9982\n651\t    rho_20pct_replacement: 0.9958\n652\t    rho_31pct_replacement: 0.9935\n653\t    rho_50pct_replacement: 0.987\n654\t    shr_5pct: 0.998\n655\t    shr_10pct: 0.996\n656\t    shr_20pct: 0.993\n657\t    shr_31pct: 0.989\n658\t    shr_50pct: 0.975\n659\t    construct_coverage_5pct: 0.99\n660\t    construct_coverage_31pct: 0.94\n661\t    construct_coverage_50pct: 0.86\n662\t    bootstrap_ci_rho_31pct:\n663\t    - 0.991\n664\t    - 0.996\n665\t    random_replacement_rho_31pct: 0.997\n666\t    targeted_dif_replacement_rho_31pct: 0.993\n667\t  result_rationale: 'median档下graceful degradation的core finding与actual plan_017一致（ρ>0.99\n668\t    even at 31% removal），但CIs wider。关键区别：(1) random replacement ρ=0.997 vs targeted\n669\t    DIF replacement ρ=0.993——DIF items carries slightly more ranking-relevant information\n670\t    than random items， 但差异small；(2) construct coverage at 31% drops to 0.94——意味着6%的construct\n671\t    coverage loss，审稿人会问这是否trivial；(3) at 50% replacement ρ=0.987仍高，confirming massive\n672\t    redundancy。但median档下审稿人会argue：(a) replacement items的calibration quality 未经验证（plan_006\n673\t    failed），所以degradation analysis假设perfect replacement是unrealistic； (b) construct\n674\t    coverage loss of 6%在certain high-stakes contexts可能non-trivial。 结论：clean supplementary\n675\t    result但不解决审稿人对replacement feasibility的concern。\n676\t\n677\t    '\n678\t  tables:\n679\t  - name: 'Table: Validity Degradation Under Progressive Replacement'\n680\t    columns:\n681\t    - replacement_pct\n682\t    - spearman_rho\n683\t    - shr\n684\t    - construct_coverage\n685\t    - ci_95_rho\n686\t    rows:\n687\t    - - 5\n688\t      - 0.9991\n689\t      - 0.998\n690\t      - 0.99\n691\t      - '[0.9988, 0.9994]'\n692\t    - - 10\n693\t      - 0.9982\n694\t      - 0.996\n695\t      - 0.98\n696\t      - '[0.9976, 0.9988]'\n697\t    - - 20\n698\t      - 0.9958\n699\t      - 0.993\n700\t      - 0.96\n701\t      - '[0.9945, 0.9971]'\n702\t    - - 31\n703\t      - 0.9935\n704\t      - 0.989\n705\t      - 0.94\n706\t      - '[0.9910, 0.9960]'\n707\t    - - 50\n708\t      - 0.987\n709\t      - 0.975\n710\t      - 0.86\n711\t      - '[0.9830, 0.9910]'\n712\t  figures_description:\n713\t  - 'Fig: ρ vs replacement rate curve. Gradual decline. Annotation at 31% showing\n714\t    DIF-targeted vs random replacement comparison.'\n715\t  analysis: 'Supports \"instability ≠ invalidity\" narrative。但在median档下，plan_006的failure意味着\n716\t    practical replacement尚不可行，so this analysis是theoretical exercise。 Appendix supplementary，支持Claim\n717\t    4的redundancy finding。\n718\t\n719\t    '\n720\t- name: item_focused_trees\n721\t  plan_id: plan_009\n722\t  description: '实现Item-Focused Trees (Tutz & Berger 2016)。将model release date作为continuous\n723\t    covariate， 避免arbitrary cohort splits。\n724\t\n725\t    '\n726\t  expected_results:\n727\t    n_items_analyzed: 12508\n728\t    ift_flagged_items_pct: 28.5\n729\t    ift_dif_mh_jaccard: 0.72\n730\t    ift_dif_mh_concordance: 0.78\n731\t    ift_unique_flags_pct: 5.2\n732\t    mh_unique_flags_pct: 7.8\n733\t    ift_temporal_gradient:\n734\t      pct_monotonic_increase: 35\n735\t      pct_monotonic_decrease: 28\n736\t      pct_nonlinear: 37\n737\t    ift_split_points_mode: 2023-Q4 to 2024-Q1\n738\t    computational_cost_ratio_vs_mh: 15\n739\t  result_rationale: 'median档下IFT flags 28.5% items（vs MH的31.3%），Jaccard=0.72说明substantial\n740\t    overlap但 不identical。IFT的added value：(1) 37% items显示nonlinear temporal pattern——DIF不是\n741\t    monotonic drift而是有discontinuities，possibly reflecting specific model release waves；\n742\t    (2) 自动发现的split point集中在2023-Q4到2024-Q1，与MH的手动temporal split一致， validating cohort定义；(3)\n743\t    5.2% IFT-unique flags是MH missed的——these tend to be items with small-but-continuous\n744\t    drift that doesn''t cross ETS C threshold。但IFT computational cost 15× MH，且37%\n745\t    nonlinear patterns增加interpretation complexity。在median档下IFT是 clean robustness check\n746\t    confirming MH findings are not artifact of arbitrary binary split， 但不改变core conclusions。审稿人appreciate\n747\t    as supplementary validation。\n748\t\n749\t    '\n750\t  tables:\n751\t  - name: 'Table: IFT vs MH-DIF Comparison'\n752\t    columns:\n753\t    - metric\n754\t    - IFT\n755\t    - MH_DIF\n756\t    rows:\n757\t    - - flagged_pct\n758\t      - 28.5\n759\t      - 31.3\n760\t    - - unique_flags_pct\n761\t      - 5.2\n762\t      - 7.8\n763\t    - - overlap_jaccard\n764\t      - 0.72\n765\t      - 0.72\n766\t    - - computational_cost_relative\n767\t      - 15x\n768\t      - 1x\n769\t  figures_description:\n770\t  - 'Fig: IFT temporal gradient for 3 example items showing monotonic increase, monotonic\n771\t    decrease, and nonlinear patterns.'\n772\t  analysis: 'IFT validates MH cohort split choice。nonlinear patterns add nuance but\n773\t    don''t change core finding。Appendix supplementary robustness check。\n774\t\n775\t    '\n776\t- name: architecture_stratified_dif\n777\t  plan_id: plan_010\n778\t  description: '在decoder-only homogeneous subpopulation上运行DIF，检验architecture heterogeneity\n779\t    是否inflates spurious DIF。\n780\t\n781\t    '\n782\t  expected_results:\n783\t    n_decoder_only: 5222\n784\t    n_non_decoder: 5\n785\t    pct_decoder_only: 99.9\n786\t    decoder_only_c_pct: 31.2\n787\t    full_population_c_pct: 31.3\n788\t    jaccard_decoder_only_vs_full: 0.998\n789\t    irt_rmsea_full: 0.082\n790\t    irt_rmsea_decoder_only: 0.081\n791\t    irt_cfi_full: 0.72\n792\t    irt_cfi_decoder_only: 0.72\n793\t    lz_pct_above_2_full: 98.0\n794\t    lz_pct_above_2_decoder_only: 97.8\n795\t  result_rationale: 'METABENCH MMLU中99.90%是decoder-only（5222/5227，排除5个encoder-decoder/encoder-only），\n796\t    所以architecture stratification几乎是no-op。C%从31.3%降至31.2%，Jaccard=0.998。 关键insight：IRT\n797\t    fit metrics完全不改善（RMSEA=0.081 vs 0.082, CFI=0.72 vs 0.72）—— 这证明|Lz|>2的98% misfit不是由architecture\n798\t    heterogeneity驱动，而是MMLU inherent multidimensionality (57 subjects forced into 1D)。在median档下，这个结果虽然是\n799\t    \"architecture is a non-issue\"的强证据，但同时expose了一个更深的问题：如果IRT fit 在homogeneous population下仍然terrible，那么所有基于1D\n800\t    IRT的DIF findings都建立在 misspecified model上。审稿人（at least one）会将98% |Lz|>2视为fundamental\n801\t    concern， 要求pilot multidimensional analysis——这是median档的defining reviewer concern之一。\n802\t\n803\t    '\n804\t  tables:\n805\t  - name: 'Table: Architecture Stratification (Non-Issue Confirmation)'\n806\t    columns:\n807\t    - population\n808\t    - N\n809\t    - c_pct\n810\t    - rmsea\n811\t    - cfi\n812\t    - lz_pct_gt2\n813\t    rows:\n814\t    - - full\n815\t      - 5227\n816\t      - 31.3\n817\t      - 0.082\n818\t      - 0.72\n819\t      - 98.0\n820\t    - - decoder_only\n821\t      - 5222\n822\t      - 31.2\n823\t      - 0.081\n824\t      - 0.72\n825\t      - 97.8\n826\t    - - delta\n827\t      - -5\n828\t      - -0.1\n829\t      - -0.001\n830\t      - 0.0\n831\t      - -0.2\n832\t  figures_description:\n833\t  - 'Fig: |Lz| distribution for full vs decoder-only populations. Nearly identical.\n834\t    Vertical line at |Lz|=2 showing 98% exceed threshold in both.'\n835\t  analysis: 'Architecture concern definitively resolved。但IRT misfit concern simultaneously\n836\t    amplified——这在median档下成为审稿人要求pilot MIRT的trigger。plan_005的bifactor failure 意味着这个concern只能部分address（2-3\n837\t    subject pilot），不能fully resolve。 在Discussion中需要explicit subsection \"IRT model misspecification\n838\t    bounds on our findings\"。\n839\t\n840\t    '\n841\t- name: semi_synthetic_contamination_validation\n842\t  plan_id: plan_011\n843\t  description: '在real METABENCH response matrix中注入known contamination，测量DIF detection\n844\t    power。 Controlled ground truth避免Li et al. proxy label的circularity。\n845\t\n846\t    '\n847\t  expected_results:\n848\t    n_clean_items: 500\n849\t    n_injected_items: 150\n850\t    temporal_external_tpr_p0: 0.31\n851\t    temporal_external_tpr_p03: 0.45\n852\t    temporal_external_tpr_p05: 0.68\n853\t    temporal_external_tpr_p07: 0.88\n854\t    temporal_external_tpr_p10: 0.97\n855\t    temporal_external_fpr: 0.31\n856\t    temporal_external_delta_tpr_p05: 0.37\n857\t    temporal_external_delta_tpr_p10: 0.66\n858\t    cross_subject_delta_fpr: 0.001\n859\t    within_subject_fpr_inflation_p10: 0.19\n860\t    matching_variable_contamination_confirmed: true\n861\t    dose_response_monotonic: true\n862\t    injection_prevalence_sensitivity:\n863\t      pct_5_delta_tpr: 0.28\n864\t      pct_10_delta_tpr: 0.33\n865\t      pct_20_delta_tpr: 0.37\n866\t      pct_30_delta_tpr: 0.4\n867\t    exploitation_rate_sensitivity:\n868\t      p_04_delta_tpr: 0.12\n869\t      p_06_delta_tpr: 0.25\n870\t      p_08_delta_tpr: 0.45\n871\t      p_10_delta_tpr: 0.66\n872\t  result_rationale: 'median档下semi-synthetic ΔTPR at p=0.5 = 0.37（在0.35-0.50 range内），低于actual的\n873\t    0.508(p=0.5)和0.674(p=1.0)。原因：(1) elevated baseline FPR=0.31意味着许多genuine DIF items\n874\t    已经被flagged在p=0（no injection），leaving less room for TPR increase on injected items；\n875\t    (2) at exploitation rate p=0.5，每个injected item仅50%概率flip incorrect→correct， effective\n876\t    DIF magnitude较小——power analysis预期δ≈0.8，落在operational region边缘 （N≥80但δ<1.4）；(3)\n877\t    cross-subject matching ΔFPR=0.001是强正面结果——matching variable contamination完全isolated，confirming\n878\t    cross-subject matching是sound methodology； (4) within-subject matching FPR inflation\n879\t    +0.19 confirms the contaminated-matching-variable problem。dose-response monotonic是clean结果。在median档下审稿人acknowledge\n880\t    ΔTPR>0 is significant但0.37 at p=0.5 is \"moderate power\"——semi-synthetic framework的value更多是\n881\t    methodology本身（reusable infrastructure）而非specific power numbers。这支持Claim 3作为 primary\n882\t    contribution的repositioning。\n883\t\n884\t    '\n885\t  tables:\n886\t  - name: 'Table: Semi-Synthetic Detection Power (Cross-Subject Matching)'\n887\t    columns:\n888\t    - exploitation_rate_p\n889\t    - tpr\n890\t    - fpr\n891\t    - delta_tpr\n892\t    - delta_fpr\n893\t    rows:\n894\t    - - 0.0_baseline\n895\t      - 0.31\n896\t      - 0.31\n897\t      - 0.0\n898\t      - 0.0\n899\t    - - 0.3\n900\t      - 0.45\n901\t      - 0.31\n902\t      - 0.14\n903\t      - 0.001\n904\t    - - 0.5\n905\t      - 0.68\n906\t      - 0.31\n907\t      - 0.37\n908\t      - 0.001\n909\t    - - 0.7\n910\t      - 0.88\n911\t      - 0.31\n912\t      - 0.57\n913\t      - 0.001\n914\t    - - 1.0\n915\t      - 0.97\n916\t      - 0.31\n917\t      - 0.66\n918\t      - 0.001\n919\t  - name: 'Table: Within-Subject vs Cross-Subject Matching FPR'\n920\t    columns:\n921\t    - matching_method\n922\t    - fpr_baseline\n923\t    - fpr_p10\n924\t    - delta_fpr\n925\t    rows:\n926\t    - - within_subject\n927\t      - 0.31\n928\t      - 0.5\n929\t      - 0.19\n930\t    - - cross_subject\n931\t      - 0.31\n932\t      - 0.311\n933\t      - 0.001\n934\t  figures_description:\n935\t  - 'Fig: Dose-response curve (ΔTPR vs exploitation rate p). Cross-subject matching\n936\t    (solid) vs within-subject (dashed). FPR inflation band for within-subject visible.'\n937\t  - 'Fig: ΔFPR across injection prevalence rates for cross-subject matching. Flat\n938\t    at ~0.001, confirming isolation.'\n939\t  analysis: 'Semi-synthetic framework是median档下最强contribution。ΔTPR=0.37 at p=0.5 is\n940\t    moderate but positive, dose-response is clean, cross-subject matching ΔFPR≈0 is\n941\t    the key methodological innovation。升级为primary contribution。审稿人在novelty score上 给2.5-3.5但acknowledge\n942\t    framework reusability。\n943\t\n944\t    '\n945\t- name: multi_benchmark_temporal_dif\n946\t  plan_id: plan_028\n947\t  description: '在METABENCH中的additional benchmarks (ARC, HellaSwag, WinoGrande, TruthfulQA)上\n948\t    运行temporal DIF，检验跨benchmark generalizability。\n949\t\n950\t    '\n951\t  expected_results:\n952\t    mmlu_c_pct: 31.3\n953\t    arc_c_pct: 22.5\n954\t    hellaswag_c_pct: 14.8\n955\t    winogrande_c_pct: 26.1\n956\t    truthfulqa_c_pct: 25.3\n957\t    gsm8k_c_pct: 15.2\n958\t    cross_benchmark_range: 14.8-31.3%\n959\t    cross_benchmark_min: 14.8\n960\t    cross_benchmark_max: 31.3\n961\t    all_above_random_control: true\n962\t    random_control_max: 0.55\n963\t    min_enrichment_ratio: 27\n964\t    benchmarks_above_15pct: 5\n965\t    benchmarks_above_20pct: 4\n966\t    benchmarks_above_25pct: 3\n967\t    arc_random_c_pct: 0.5\n968\t    hellaswag_random_c_pct: 0.22\n969\t    winogrande_random_c_pct: 0.35\n970\t    truthfulqa_random_c_pct: 0.4\n971\t  result_rationale: 'median档下cross-benchmark C% range为14.8-31.3%（在12-18% min, 28-32%\n972\t    max range内）。 HellaSwag最低(14.8%)因为：(1) commonsense reasoning items更homogeneous，temporal\n973\t    drift 较小；(2) 10042 items中许多是pattern-matching tasks，less susceptible to differential\n974\t    functioning across model generations。MMLU最高(31.3%)因为57 subjects的heterogeneity\n975\t    创造了更多DIF opportunity。ARC/WinoGrande/TruthfulQA在22-26%范围内。关键observation： 所有6个benchmarks的C%都远高于random\n976\t    control (<0.6%)，enrichment ratio≥27，所以temporal DIF is pervasive。但median档下HellaSwag的14.8%略低于15%\n977\t    \"flag\" threshold（audit protocol three-tier中<15 = monitor only），这给了审稿人一个talking\n978\t    point：\"not all benchmarks reach concerning levels\"。需要honest报告：4/6 benchmarks above\n979\t    20%，2/6 below 20%。 Cross-benchmark generalizability is \"substantial but variable\"而非\"universal\"。\n980\t\n981\t    '\n982\t  tables:\n983\t  - name: 'Table: Multi-Benchmark Temporal DIF (2023 vs 2024)'\n984\t    columns:\n985\t    - benchmark\n986\t    - n_items\n987\t    - n_ref\n988\t    - n_foc\n989\t    - c_pct\n990\t    - random_c_pct\n991\t    - enrichment_ratio\n992\t    - audit_tier\n993\t    rows:\n994\t    - - MMLU\n995\t      - 12508\n996\t      - 1080\n997\t      - 807\n998\t      - 31.3\n999\t      - 0.18\n1000\t      - 174\n1001\t      - act\n1002\t    - - WinoGrande\n1003\t      - 1267\n1004\t      - 1017\n1005\t      - 803\n1006\t      - 26.1\n1007\t      - 0.35\n1008\t      - 75\n1009\t      - flag\n1010\t    - - TruthfulQA\n1011\t      - 817\n1012\t      - 1080\n1013\t      - 807\n1014\t      - 25.3\n1015\t      - 0.4\n1016\t      - 63\n1017\t      - flag\n1018\t    - - ARC\n1019\t      - 1172\n1020\t      - 1080\n1021\t      - 807\n1022\t      - 22.5\n1023\t      - 0.5\n1024\t      - 45\n1025\t      - flag\n1026\t    - - GSM8K\n1027\t      - 1319\n1028\t      - 1017\n1029\t      - 804\n1030\t      - 15.2\n1031\t      - 0.25\n1032\t      - 61\n1033\t      - flag\n1034\t    - - HellaSwag\n1035\t      - 10042\n1036\t      - 1080\n1037\t      - 807\n1038\t      - 14.8\n1039\t      - 0.22\n1040\t      - 67\n1041\t      - monitor\n1042\t  figures_description:\n1043\t  - 'Fig: Bar chart of C% by benchmark with random control overlay. All bars far exceed\n1044\t    random. Horizontal lines at 15% (monitor) and 25% (flag) thresholds.'\n1045\t  analysis: 'Multi-benchmark DIF strengthens generalizability claim但reveals variability。\n1046\t    median档下HellaSwag < 15%给审稿人ammunition。framing应为\"temporal measurement drift is\n1047\t    a general phenomenon across LLM benchmarks (all >> random), with benchmark-specific\n1048\t    magnitude reflecting task and item characteristics\"。honest reporting of range。\n1049\t\n1050\t    '\n1051\t- name: permutation_null_c_rate\n1052\t  plan_id: plan_029\n1053\t  description: '1000× permutation test: 随机reassign temporal labels，建立C%的null distribution。\n1054\t    回答\"31% is above chance?\"\n1055\t\n1056\t    '\n1057\t  expected_results:\n1058\t    n_permutations: 1000\n1059\t    null_c_pct_mean: 5.2\n1060\t    null_c_pct_sd: 0.8\n1061\t    null_c_pct_95th_percentile: 6.5\n1062\t    null_c_pct_99th_percentile: 7.3\n1063\t    null_c_pct_max: 8.1\n1064\t    observed_c_pct: 31.3\n1065\t    permutation_p_value: <0.001\n1066\t    z_score_observed_vs_null: 32.6\n1067\t    excess_c_pct: 26.1\n1068\t    within_cohort_random_split_c_pct: 0.18\n1069\t    ratio_permutation_null_to_random_split: 28.9\n1070\t  result_rationale: 'median档下permutation null C%=5.2%（在3-8% range内），远高于within-cohort\n1071\t    random split 的0.18%但远低于observed 31.3%。5.2% null rate意味着：(1) temporal labels本身携带non-DIF\n1072\t    signal——当你随机shuffe 2023/2024 labels时，模型composition的statistical properties (ability\n1073\t    distribution, family structure, training recipe distribution) 被破坏，但残留的 correlations\n1074\t    between temporal label和model characteristics仍然产生~5% spurious DIF； (2) 这不是type-I\n1075\t    error——permutation test正确preserve了model-level dependencies， 5.2%反映的是temporal label作为proxy\n1076\t    for multiple confounds的composite effect； (3) observed 31.3%仍以z=32.6 highly significant\n1077\t    (p<0.001)，excess=26.1%是genuine。 但审稿人会argue：(a) 5.2% null不trivial，说明temporal labels不是clean\n1078\t    experimental manipulation；(b) permutation test只controls for label assignment，不controls\n1079\t    for systematic differences in cohort composition（ability, training data vintage等）——\n1080\t    plan_027的ability matching只addresses one such confound；(c) 真正的\"after all controls\"\n1081\t    estimate可能需要subtract更多confounds。median档下effective C%=24.5%（31.3% - 5.2% null -\n1082\t    2.4pp ability - ~1pp other adjustments ≈ 22-25%）。审稿人接受这是significant但 要求更careful\n1083\t    attribution。\n1084\t\n1085\t    '\n1086\t  tables:\n1087\t  - name: 'Table: Permutation Null Distribution'\n1088\t    columns:\n1089\t    - statistic\n1090\t    - value\n1091\t    rows:\n1092\t    - - null_mean_c_pct\n1093\t      - 5.2\n1094\t    - - null_sd\n1095\t      - 0.8\n1096\t    - - null_95th_percentile\n1097\t      - 6.5\n1098\t    - - null_99th_percentile\n1099\t      - 7.3\n1100\t    - - null_max\n1101\t      - 8.1\n1102\t    - - observed_c_pct\n1103\t      - 31.3\n1104\t    - - excess_over_null_mean\n1105\t      - 26.1\n1106\t    - - z_score\n1107\t      - 32.6\n1108\t    - - permutation_p\n1109\t      - <0.001\n1110\t    - - within_cohort_random_c_pct\n1111\t      - 0.18\n1112\t  figures_description:\n1113\t  - 'Fig: Histogram of 1000 permutation null C% values (mean=5.2%, tight distribution).\n1114\t    Vertical red line at observed 31.3%. Massive separation. Inset shows null distribution\n1115\t    detail.'\n1116\t  analysis: 'Permutation null是median档的defining result。5.2%建立了proper baseline——31.3%仍highly\n1117\t    significant但需要honest报告excess=~26%而非31%。审稿人一的concern不是significance 而是interpretation：\"what\n1118\t    does the 5.2% null represent?\" 这需要explicit discussion of temporal label as composite\n1119\t    proxy for multiple factors (ability, training data, architecture evolution, RLHF\n1120\t    practices)。median档下这个5.2%成为\"conservative controls\" narrative的anchor point。\n1121\t\n1122\t    '\n1123\t- name: odds_ratio_regression_transparency\n1124\t  plan_id: plan_030\n1125\t  description: '补充odds ratio + 95% CI + McFadden/Nagelkerke R² + deviance ratio。 Item-level\n1126\t    accuracy change作为finer-grained predictor。\n1127\t\n1128\t    '\n1129\t  expected_results:\n1130\t    model1_domain_delta:\n1131\t      mcfadden_r2: 0.0007\n1132\t      nagelkerke_r2: 0.0012\n1133\t      subject_acc_delta_or_per_010: 1.55\n1134\t      subject_acc_delta_ci_per_010:\n1135\t      - 1.19\n1136\t      - 2.03\n1137\t    model2_domain_delta_plus_items:\n1138\t      mcfadden_r2: 0.042\n1139\t      nagelkerke_r2: 0.071\n1140\t      ctt_difficulty_or_per_010: 0.78\n1141\t      ctt_discrimination_or_per_010: 1.51\n1142\t    model3_item_delta:\n1143\t      mcfadden_r2: 0.0012\n1144\t      nagelkerke_r2: 0.0021\n1145\t      item_acc_change_or_per_010: 1.08\n1146\t      item_acc_change_ci:\n1147\t      - 1.02\n1148\t      - 1.14\n1149\t    model4_item_delta_plus_items:\n1150\t      mcfadden_r2: 0.043\n1151\t      nagelkerke_r2: 0.073\n1152\t      simpsons_paradox: true\n1153\t    lr_test_m1_vs_m2_chi2: 645\n1154\t    lr_test_m3_vs_m4_chi2: 653\n1155\t    best_model_r2: 0.073\n1156\t    deviance_explained_pct: 7.3\n1157\t  result_rationale: 'median档下odds ratio regression结果与actual一致——这是deterministic statistical\n1158\t    analysis on fixed data。McFadden R²=0.0007 (domain-level predictor alone) confirms\n1159\t    domain improvement explains essentially nothing at item level。Model 4 (item Δ\n1160\t    + item props) 的Nagelkerke R²=0.073意味着所有可观测predictors combined仅解释7.3%的DIF variance——\n1161\t    92.7%是unexplained，supporting \"instability is predominantly item-specific\"。 Simpson''s\n1162\t    paradox在Model 2→4 transition中再现：item accuracy change OR从1.55 (positive, Model\n1163\t    1)翻转为0.92 (negative, Model 4) when item properties are controlled——说明 difficulty和discrimination是confounders。在median档下审稿人accept这作为thorough\n1164\t    transparency analysis但会note：(1) 7.3% total R² means our understanding of DIF drivers\n1165\t    is very limited; (2) unmeasured item-level confounds (topic specificity, question\n1166\t    format, cognitive level) might explain more; (3) Simpson''s paradox means Model\n1167\t    1 should NOT be used for causal interpretation。paper应使用Model 1 as primary (descriptive)\n1168\t    with Model 4 as supplementary (adjusted)。\n1169\t\n1170\t    '\n1171\t  tables:\n1172\t  - name: 'Table: Logistic Regression Models for DIF Prediction'\n1173\t    columns:\n1174\t    - model\n1175\t    - predictors\n1176\t    - mcfadden_r2\n1177\t    - nagelkerke_r2\n1178\t    - aic\n1179\t    - key_or\n1180\t    rows:\n1181\t    - - M1\n1182\t      - domain_acc_delta\n1183\t      - 0.0007\n1184\t      - 0.0012\n1185\t      - 15545\n1186\t      - 1.55 per 0.10\n1187\t    - - M2\n1188\t      - M1 + item_props\n1189\t      - 0.042\n1190\t      - 0.071\n1191\t      - 14902\n1192\t      - difficulty 0.78, disc 1.51\n1193\t    - - M3\n1194\t      - item_acc_delta\n1195\t      - 0.0012\n1196\t      - 0.0021\n1197\t      - 15537\n1198\t      - 1.08 per 0.10\n1199\t    - - M4\n1200\t      - M3 + item_props\n1201\t      - 0.043\n1202\t      - 0.073\n1203\t      - 14885\n1204\t      - acc_Δ 0.92 (reversed)\n1205\t  figures_description:\n1206\t  - 'Fig: Forest plot of ORs (per 0.10 unit) across 4 models. Simpson''s paradox highlighted:\n1207\t    acc_delta OR flips from >1 to <1 when item properties are added.'\n1208\t  analysis: Odds ratio transparency analysis是clean supplementary work。confirms <8%\n1209\t    variance explained。在median档下审稿人appreciate transparency but note limited explanatory\n1210\t    power as a gap. Simpson's paradox需要explicit discussion as a caution for interpretation.\n1211\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5cd71339-111f-48a8-a236-8ba5633aebc2","uuid":"aaaf7fd0-c703-4f5b-b3d6-10cbf946e23d","timestamp":"2026-05-21T17:40:26.109Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0520_2/projects/irt_equated_bench_regen/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260521T165710/median/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'Claim 1从''31% instability''降调为''20-28% after conservative controls''——permutation\n  null 5.2%虽仍显著但审稿人 质疑temporal label携带非DIF信号(cohort composition shift, training data\n  vintage correlation)。RL robustness 降级为limitation (N=13, Jaccard=0.75, inconclusive)。Claim\n  2 meta-critique需补充ConStat/Min-K%在 web-overlap labels上的具体failure case analysis。Claim\n  3 semi-synthetic framework升级为primary contribution (ΔTPR=0.42 at p=0.5，cross-subject\n  ΔFPR<0.001稳健)。整体定位从''discovery paper''调整为 ''methodological contribution (semi-synthetic\n  framework) + empirical case study (temporal DIF on MMLU)''。 增加explicit discussion\n  ''IRT model misspecification bounds''，pilot bifactor on 2-3 subjects。 8页压缩勉强可行但GSM1K\n  exploratory和circularity ablation细节移入appendix。reviewer avg 3.0-3.5, novelty score\n  2.5-3.5, 需major revision后accept。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: real_data_dif_mmlu\n  plan_id: plan_001\n  description: '对METABENCH MMLU响应矩阵(5219×12508)运行MH-DIF。temporal cohort (2023 vs 2024-H1)、\n    ability quintile、within-family confound control、domain-specificity分析。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    temporal_ets_c_pct: 31.3\n    temporal_fpr_li_clean: 0.32\n    temporal_enrichment: 0.96\n    ability_ets_c_pct: 2.9\n    ability_enrichment: 1.19\n    within_family_llama2v3_c_pct: 61.3\n    within_family_mistral_mixtral_c_pct: 38.7\n    domain_spearman_rho: 0.31\n    domain_spearman_p: 0.02\n    sanity_random_split_c_pct: 0.18\n    effective_c_pct_after_all_controls: 24.5\n    domain_specificity_range: 20.7-48.4%\n    unweighted_mean_c_pct: 30.6\n  result_rationale: 'Raw C%=31.3%与实际一致——这是MH-DIF在该数据上的机械输出，不受tier影响。median档的关键区别在于\n    downstream interpretation：permutation null将揭示3-8%的baseline（plan_029），ability matching\n    扣除2.4pp（plan_027），combined controls将effective estimate压至~24.5%。enrichment≈1.0仍成立\n    因为Li et al. labels本质上测量的是global exposure而非differential contamination——这个null result是结构性的，与tier无关。domain\n    correlation ρ=0.31 (p=0.02)在subject level是modest ecological correlation，item-level\n    decomposition（plan_019/030）将显示domain improvement仅解释≤2.4pp。 within-family Llama-2v3的61.3%反映了巨大的ability\n    gap (d=-0.99)，ability matching后降至~28%， 与temporal cohort matched estimate收敛——这支持~24-29%是genuine\n    item-level DIF的估计。 median档下审稿人会argue 24.5%虽显著但不如31.3%那么striking，且temporal label可能携带\n    training data vintage以外的confound（e.g., RLHF protocol evolution, tokenizer changes）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 1: Temporal DIF Summary (Median Tier Interpretation)'\n    columns:\n    - cohort_definition\n    - n_ref\n    - n_foc\n    - raw_c_pct\n    - permutation_null_c_pct\n    - ability_adjusted_c_pct\n    - effective_c_pct\n    rows:\n    - - temporal_2023v2024\n      - 1080\n      - 807\n      - 31.3\n      - 5.2\n      - 28.9\n      - 24.5\n    - - ability_quintile\n      - 2100\n      - 2100\n      - 2.9\n      - 0.3\n      - —\n      - 2.6\n    - - random_split_sanity\n      - 950\n      - 950\n      - 0.18\n      - —\n      - —\n      - ~0\n  - name: 'Table 2: Within-Family Confound Control'\n    columns:\n    - family_pair\n    - raw_c_pct\n    - cohens_d\n    - ability_matched_c_pct\n    - interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - Llama-2_vs_Llama-3\n      - 61.3\n      - -0.99\n      - 28.3\n      - ability confound explains 33pp\n    - - Mistral_vs_Mixtral\n      - 38.7\n      - -0.45\n      - ~30\n      - moderate ability confound\n    - - Temporal_2023v2024\n      - 31.3\n      - -0.17\n      - 28.9\n      - ability confound explains 2.4pp\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 1: C% by MMLU subject (57 bars), horizontal line at permutation null mean=5.2%.\n    All subjects above null, range 20.7-48.4%. Shaded band shows effective range 20-28%\n    after controls.'\n  - 'Fig 2: Scatter plot domain accuracy improvement vs subject C%, ρ=0.31. Annotation:\n    item-level R²<0.001.'\n  analysis: 'Raw 31.3%数据不变，但median档的叙事必须承认：(1) permutation null 5.2%意味着temporal label\n    本身携带约5pp的非DIF信号；(2) ability matching扣除2.4pp；(3) 合计conservative estimate为 ~24.5%。审稿人会要求明确报告effective\n    C%而非仅raw C%。仍然是substantial finding （24.5% >> random 0.18%），但从\"approximately 31%\"降调为\"20-28%\n    after conservative controls\"。 domain correlation ρ=0.31虽p<0.05但explanatory power极低（R²<0.001\n    at item level）， 支持instability is item-specific而非domain-driven的结论。\n\n    '\n- name: rl_robustness_validation\n  plan_id: plan_002\n  description: '验证DIF对RL训练的鲁棒性。SFT baseline + alignment-RL (DPO/ORPO, N=477) + reasoning-RL\n    (GRPO/PPO, N=13)。对比DIF vs ConStat vs Min-K%在各cohort上的表现。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_reasoning_rl_models: 13\n    n_alignment_rl_models: 477\n    n_sft_baseline: 350\n    dif_flag_jaccard_sft_vs_sft_plus_alignment_rl: 0.92\n    dif_flag_jaccard_sft_vs_sft_plus_reasoning_rl: 0.75\n    dif_flag_jaccard_sft_vs_all_combined: 0.78\n    bootstrap_jaccard_ci_reasoning_rl:\n    - 0.62\n    - 0.87\n    constat_auroc_sft: 0.72\n    constat_auroc_alignment_rl: 0.68\n    constat_auroc_reasoning_rl: 0.58\n    mink_auroc_sft: 0.75\n    mink_auroc_reasoning_rl: 0.62\n    dif_c_pct_sft_only_cohort: 30.8\n    dif_c_pct_with_reasoning_rl: 28.2\n    auroc_drop_constat_sft_to_rl: 0.14\n    auroc_drop_mink_sft_to_rl: 0.13\n    tost_equivalence_p: 0.18\n    delong_dif_vs_constat_p: 0.34\n    power_analysis_partial_exploitation:\n      p_04_detection_boundary_delta: 1.8\n      p_06_detection_boundary_delta: 1.5\n      p_08_detection_boundary_delta: 1.3\n      p_10_detection_boundary_delta: 1.0\n  result_rationale: 'N=13 reasoning-RL模型是median档的核心瓶颈。alignment-RL (DPO/ORPO)不产生NLL\n    gap contraction， 因此Jaccard=0.92与SFT几乎无差异——这不是RL-robustness的有效测试。真正的测试是reasoning-RL\n    (GRPO/PPO)，但N=13意味着：(1) 将13个模型加入focal cohort（N=807→820）对群体级DIF统计量 影响微弱，Jaccard=0.75反映的是sampling\n    variability而非systematic degradation；(2) Bootstrap CI [0.62, 0.87]跨越了\"moderate\n    shift\"和\"essentially stable\"的分界线；(3) TOST equivalence test p=0.18无法reject non-equivalence，即无法正式claim\n    equivalence。traditional detectors (ConStat, Min-K%) 在reasoning-RL上AUROC下降0.13-0.14，但N=13的individual-level比较power极低，CI覆盖null。\n    结论：DIF flags shift moderate但方向不确定，无法claim RL-robust也无法claim RL-breaks-DIF。 必须降级为limitation：\"RL\n    robustness remains an open question due to insufficient reasoning-RL sample size\"。partial\n    exploitation power analysis是clean theoretical result但缺乏empirical validation。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: RL Robustness Summary'\n    columns:\n    - cohort_composition\n    - n_total_foc\n    - dif_c_pct\n    - jaccard_vs_baseline\n    - constat_auroc\n    - mink_auroc\n    rows:\n    - - SFT_only\n      - 350\n      - 30.8\n      - 1.0\n      - 0.72\n      - 0.75\n    - - SFT+alignment_RL\n      - 827\n      - 31.0\n      - 0.92\n      - 0.68\n      - 0.71\n    - - SFT+reasoning_RL\n      - 363\n      - 28.2\n      - 0.75\n      - 0.58\n      - 0.62\n    - - All_combined\n      - 840\n      - 29.5\n      - 0.78\n      - 0.65\n      - 0.67\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Jaccard stability as function of reasoning-RL fraction in focal cohort.\n    Bootstrap CIs shown. Dashed line at Jaccard=0.80 (stability threshold). CI crosses\n    threshold at N_RL≈10.'\n  analysis: 'median档下RL robustness是最弱的claim。Jaccard=0.75在0.65-0.85范围内，审稿人会正确指出： (1)\n    N=13不足以区分genuine degradation和sampling noise；(2) alignment-RL的high Jaccard不证明 RL-robustness因为DPO不是target\n    mechanism；(3) TOST failure意味着equivalence未被证明。 唯一可写的是\"DIF shows moderate stability\n    when reasoning-RL models are added to the cohort, but the small sample precludes\n    definitive conclusions\"——这作为limitation而非robustness evidence。\n\n    '\n- name: constat_perturbation_eval\n  plan_id: plan_003a\n  description: '独立评估ConStat-style perturbation testing在MMLU上的表现。LLM paraphrasing生成语义等价\n    reformulations，比较原始与改写性能差异。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_items_paraphrased: 220\n    paraphrase_semantic_similarity_mean: 0.91\n    paraphrase_quality_human_rating: 3.8\n    constat_detection_auroc_all_models: 0.63\n    constat_detection_auroc_non_rl: 0.67\n    constat_detection_auroc_rl_models: 0.51\n    fdr_controlled_suspicious_pct: 14.2\n    constat_dif_overlap_jaccard: 0.13\n    constat_dif_overlap_phi: 0.08\n    constat_fpr_at_05_threshold: 0.11\n    constat_tpr_at_05_threshold: 0.38\n    web_overlap_label_concordance: 0.22\n  result_rationale: 'ConStat检测verbatim contamination via performance drop on paraphrased\n    items。在median档下： (1) paraphrasing quality足够（similarity=0.91）但不完美——部分reformulation可能改变了cognitive\n    demand而非仅surface form，引入noise；(2) non-RL models AUROC=0.67是moderate但not strong，因为\n    MMLU的4-choice format天然限制了performance variance（25% floor）；(3) RL models AUROC≈0.51\n    接近chance，验证了Wang et al.的concern——reasoning-RL models不依赖verbatim memorization；\n    (4) ConStat-DIF overlap极低（Jaccard=0.13）因为两种方法测量不同construct：ConStat测量 individual\n    model对specific item的memorization，DIF测量cohort-level differential functioning。 这个低overlap支持Claim\n    2的meta-critique但审稿人会质疑：如果两种方法如此不同，是否说明 DIF并非测量contamination而是测量something else\n    entirely？median档下这个tension无法完全resolve。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: ConStat Detection by Model Category'\n    columns:\n    - model_category\n    - n_models\n    - auroc\n    - fdr_q05_flags_pct\n    - overlap_dif_jaccard\n    rows:\n    - - SFT_only\n      - 15\n      - 0.67\n      - 16.3\n      - 0.14\n    - - alignment_RL\n      - 12\n      - 0.64\n      - 13.8\n      - 0.12\n    - - reasoning_RL\n      - 8\n      - 0.51\n      - 8.1\n      - 0.09\n    - - all\n      - 35\n      - 0.63\n      - 14.2\n      - 0.13\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Venn diagram of DIF-C flags vs ConStat suspicious items vs Li et al. web-overlap\n    positives. Triple overlap < 5%.'\n  analysis: 'ConStat结果支持\"不同检测方法测量不同contamination constructs\"的叙事，但median档下的AUROC 偏低，审稿人可能质疑paraphrasing\n    methodology。作为Claim 2的empirical scaffolding有用但不够strong。 降级为appendix baseline comparison。\n\n    '\n- name: dvd_generation_variance_eval\n  plan_id: plan_003b\n  description: '在MMLU上独立评估DVD generation variance检测。对10-15个开源模型生成多次responses， 计算variance\n    scores，检测bimodal distributions。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_models_tested: 12\n    n_responses_per_item: 50\n    temperature: 0.8\n    bimodal_items_pct: 7.8\n    bimodal_dif_overlap_jaccard: 0.11\n    generation_variance_contamination_auroc: 0.58\n    variant_contamination_detection_auroc: 0.55\n    verbatim_contamination_detection_auroc: 0.62\n    signal_to_noise_ratio: 1.3\n    temperature_sensitivity_auroc_range:\n    - 0.52\n    - 0.64\n  result_rationale: 'DVD依赖generation variance作为contamination signal：contaminated items应有lower\n    variance （模型确定性更高）。在median档下：(1) MMLU是4-choice MCQ，generation variance本质上是 logit\n    variance over 4 options——信号空间极窄；(2) 7.8% bimodal items远低于DIF的31.3%， 且overlap极低（Jaccard=0.11），说明DVD捕获的是不同phenomenon（可能是item\n    ambiguity 而非contamination）；(3) AUROC=0.58仅略高于chance，signal-to-noise=1.3不足以作为 reliable\n    detector；(4) temperature sensitivity range [0.52, 0.64]说明结果对hyperparameter fragile。在median档下DVD\n    essentially fails as a standalone detector on MCQ benchmarks。 这支持ensemble的motivation但也限制了ensemble的ceiling。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: DVD Detection Performance'\n    columns:\n    - contamination_type\n    - auroc\n    - bimodal_pct\n    - snr\n    rows:\n    - - verbatim\n      - 0.62\n      - 9.2\n      - 1.5\n    - - variant\n      - 0.55\n      - 6.1\n      - 1.1\n    - - overall\n      - 0.58\n      - 7.8\n      - 1.3\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Generation variance distribution for DIF-C vs non-DIF items. Largely overlapping,\n    weak separation.'\n  analysis: 'DVD在MCQ benchmarks上表现差是expected——4选1格式的generation variance信号极弱。 在median档下这成为negative\n    result，进一步支持Claim 2的论点：现有per-model detectors 各有structural limitations。但negative\n    result本身不够novel，移入appendix。\n\n    '\n- name: ensemble_fusion\n  plan_id: plan_003c\n  description: '融合DIF + ConStat + DVD为multi-signal ensemble。2-of-3 majority voting和weighted\n    fusion。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    ensemble_auroc_majority_vote: 0.66\n    ensemble_auroc_weighted: 0.69\n    ensemble_fpr_at_05: 0.13\n    ensemble_coverage_theoretical: DIF≥1.4, ConStat≥0.6, DVD variant\n    ensemble_improvement_over_best_individual: 0.02\n    cross_validation_weight_variance: 0.18\n    uniform_weight_auroc: 0.65\n    optimized_weight_auroc: 0.69\n    overfitting_gap: 0.04\n  result_rationale: 'Ensemble ceiling受限于weakest components。在median档下：(1) DVD AUROC≈0.58几乎是noise，\n    实际上是2-signal ensemble (DIF+ConStat) with DVD as dead weight；(2) weighted fusion\n    仅比best individual (DIF) 提升+0.02，且cross-validation显示weight variance=0.18—— 说明optimal\n    weights unstable across folds，overfitting gap=0.04；(3) majority voting AUROC=0.66略低于weighted因为DVD的noise票拉低了precision；(4)\n    FPR=0.13勉强满足<0.15 但不satisfying。整体来看ensemble contribution marginal，不足以作为standalone\n    contribution。 在median档下ensemble被correctly dropped from main claims（与Dream #6 consensus一致）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Ensemble Performance Comparison'\n    columns:\n    - method\n    - auroc\n    - fpr\n    - tpr_at_fpr_10\n    rows:\n    - - DIF_only\n      - 0.67\n      - 0.31\n      - 0.52\n    - - ConStat_only\n      - 0.63\n      - 0.11\n      - 0.38\n    - - DVD_only\n      - 0.58\n      - 0.15\n      - 0.28\n    - - Majority_vote\n      - 0.66\n      - 0.13\n      - 0.45\n    - - Weighted_fusion\n      - 0.69\n      - 0.12\n      - 0.49\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: ROC curves for individual detectors and ensemble methods. Ensemble marginal\n    improvement visible only in mid-FPR range.'\n  analysis: 'Ensemble不提供sufficient added value。correctly dropped from contributions。\n    在appendix作为\"we tried this, marginal improvement\"的completeness disclosure。 审稿人不会要求ensemble作为contribution，但会appreciate\n    transparency。\n\n    '\n- name: cross_benchmark_gsm8k\n  plan_id: plan_004\n  description: '在GSM8K (1319 items × 6702 models)上复制DIF分析。GSM1K作为contamination ground\n    truth。 Semi-synthetic validation。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    gsm8k_temporal_c_pct: 15.2\n    gsm8k_sanity_c_pct: 0.25\n    gsm8k_standard_external_spearman: 0.91\n    semi_synthetic_delta_tpr_p05: 0.42\n    semi_synthetic_delta_tpr_p10: 0.68\n    semi_synthetic_standard_delta_tpr_p10: 0.72\n    gsm1k_correlation_n: 33\n    gsm1k_pearson_r: -0.35\n    gsm1k_pearson_p: 0.045\n    gsm1k_spearman_rho: -0.3\n    gsm1k_spearman_p: 0.09\n    gsm1k_pearson_ci_95:\n    - -0.62\n    - -0.02\n    partial_r_controlling_accuracy: -0.28\n    partial_p: 0.11\n    leave_one_out_r_range:\n    - -0.45\n    - -0.22\n  result_rationale: 'median档下GSM8K C%=15.2%（在cross_benchmark_c_pct_min range 12-18%内），低于MMLU的31.3%。\n    这反映GSM8K的structural特点：(1) 单一domain (math)意味着DIF更多反映capability improvement 而非item-specific\n    instability；(2) 1319 items远少于MMLU的12508，statistical power lower。 semi-synthetic\n    ΔTPR=0.42 at p=0.5（在0.35-0.50 range内），低于actual的0.834(standard)和 0.517(external)——median档预期cross-subject\n    matching在single-domain benchmark上效率较低， 因为\"other subjects\"不存在于GSM8K，只能用external\n    ability measures。GSM1K correlation在 median档下weakened：r=-0.35 (vs actual -0.478)，N=33使得CI极宽[-0.62,\n    -0.02]，Spearman p=0.09不显著。partial correlation controlling accuracy p=0.11也不显著。审稿人会argue这\n    不够strong作为validation evidence——correctly demoted to exploratory。方向仍是NEGATIVE (opposite\n    to contamination hypothesis)，这对叙事是complicating factor。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: GSM8K Temporal DIF'\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - value\n    - ci_95_lower\n    - ci_95_upper\n    rows:\n    - - temporal_c_pct\n      - 15.2\n      - 12.8\n      - 17.9\n    - - semi_synthetic_delta_tpr_p05\n      - 0.42\n      - 0.31\n      - 0.54\n    - - gsm1k_pearson_r\n      - -0.35\n      - -0.62\n      - -0.02\n    - - gsm1k_spearman_rho\n      - -0.3\n      - -0.59\n      - 0.05\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: GSM8K DIF-C fraction vs GSM1K contamination gap scatter (N=33). Negative\n    trend with wide CI band. Deepseek-math-7b-rl as outlier annotated.'\n  analysis: 'GSM8K replication confirms framework portability但signal weaker。C%=15.2%在single-domain\n    benchmark上reasonable。GSM1K correlation direction puzzling (NEGATIVE)且median档下\n    barely significant——demoted to exploratory appendix。semi-synthetic ΔTPR=0.42 is\n    the strongest deliverable: confirms detection power on independent benchmark。\n\n    '\n- name: bifactor_irt_equating_pilot\n  plan_id: plan_005\n  description: '在MMLU上pilot bifactor IRT model (general + 57 subject-specific factors)。\n    选择anchor items，fixed-parameter calibration equating。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    convergence: false\n    full_model_attempted: true\n    n_subjects: 57\n    convergence_failure_reason: 57 group factors + 12508 items exceeds estimation\n      capacity\n    subset_5_subjects_converged: true\n    subset_5_bifactor_rmsea: 0.038\n    subset_5_cfi: 0.89\n    subset_5_general_factor_variance_explained: 0.42\n    subset_5_specific_factor_variance_explained: 0.31\n    subset_5_residual: 0.27\n    target_cfi: 0.95\n    target_met: false\n    equating_pilot_rho: 0.91\n    equating_pilot_target: 0.95\n    equating_pilot_met: false\n  result_rationale: 'median档下bifactor model在full MMLU上不收敛——57个subject-specific factors\n    × 12508 items 的参数空间对于mirt estimation来说太大（即使用EM或MHRM）。5-subject subset收敛但fit below\n    target：CFI=0.89 < 0.95 target，说明即使bifactor也不能adequately capture MMLU的 multidimensional\n    structure。general factor仅解释42% variance意味着subject-specific factors 和residual各占约30%——MMLU确实是highly\n    multidimensional。equating pilot在这些suboptimal parameters下达到ρ=0.91，低于0.95 target。结论：bifactor\n    approach technically infeasible at scale且fit insufficient——killed as in actual\n    registry。但median档下这个negative result 被一个审稿人视为重要：要求至少报告2-3 subject的pilot MIRT analysis来bound\n    IRT misspecification对DIF findings的影响。这成为revision要求。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Bifactor Pilot on 5-Subject Subset'\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - observed\n    - target\n    - met\n    rows:\n    - - RMSEA\n      - 0.038\n      - <0.05\n      - true\n    - - CFI\n      - 0.89\n      - '>0.95'\n      - false\n    - - TLI\n      - 0.86\n      - '>0.95'\n      - false\n    - - general_variance_pct\n      - 42\n      - '>60'\n      - false\n    - - equating_rho\n      - 0.91\n      - '>0.95'\n      - false\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Bifactor path diagram for 5-subject subset showing general + specific factor\n    loadings. Substantial specific factor variance visible.'\n  analysis: 'Bifactor killed但negative result有价值：quantifies IRT misspecification severity。\n    median档下审稿人要求至少pilot 2-3 subject的MIRT作为revision补充实验，to show that DIF findings在multidimensional\n    framework下方向一致（即使magnitude可能change）。 这是major revision的核心要求之一。\n\n    '\n- name: item_generation_calibration\n  plan_id: plan_006\n  description: '为DIF-flagged items生成replacement items。LLM generation + student simulation\n    calibration。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_items_generated: 150\n    difficulty_correlation_prompt_based: 0.32\n    difficulty_correlation_student_sim: 0.48\n    target_difficulty_correlation: 0.75\n    target_met: false\n    cognitive_level_match_pct: 62\n    subject_match_pct: 100\n    holdout_panel_validation_rho: 0.41\n    generation_quality_human_rating: 3.2\n  result_rationale: 'item generation在median档下below benchmarks。prompt-based difficulty\n    targeting ρ=0.32 与literature一致（arXiv 2602.06631报告0.10-0.45）。student simulation\n    calibration提升到 ρ=0.48但仍远低于0.75 target——原因：(1) MMLU items涵盖57个specialized domains，LLM生成\n    在specialized knowledge items上quality不稳定；(2) student simulation (arXiv 2601.09953)\n    的r=0.75-0.82是在其own benchmark上的，transfer到MMLU-style items有gap；(3) cognitive level\n    matching仅62%说明生成的items常常shift了cognitive demand（e.g., 从recall变成reasoning）。 结论：item\n    generation pipeline尚不mature enough for equating——correctly dropped from main claims。这与bifactor\n    failure combined意味着Claim 3 (regeneration/equating) is dead。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Item Generation Quality'\n    columns:\n    - calibration_method\n    - difficulty_rho\n    - cognitive_match_pct\n    - overall_quality\n    rows:\n    - - prompt_only\n      - 0.32\n      - 58\n      - 2.8\n    - - student_simulation\n      - 0.48\n      - 62\n      - 3.2\n    - - target\n      - 0.75\n      - 80\n      - 4.0\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Scatter of generated item difficulty vs target difficulty. Wide dispersion,\n    ρ=0.48.'\n  analysis: 'Item generation correctly killed。不作为contribution。但作为appendix supplementary\n    对future work有reference value。\n\n    '\n- name: cumulative_bayesian_dif\n  plan_id: plan_007\n  description: '实现cumulative Bayesian DIF priors (Sinharay et al. 2006)。模拟4次successive\n    benchmark administrations，展示累积evidence的power improvement。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    single_admin_power_medium: 0.4\n    cumulative_2_admin_power: 0.48\n    cumulative_3_admin_power: 0.55\n    cumulative_4_admin_power: 0.61\n    target_3_admin_power: 0.7\n    target_met: false\n    delta_10_effect:\n      single: 0.4\n      cumulative_3: 0.55\n    delta_14_effect:\n      single: 0.68\n      cumulative_3: 0.82\n    false_positive_rate_cumulative: 0.058\n    prior_specification: N(0, sigma=1.5)\n  result_rationale: 'median档下cumulative power at 3 administrations仅达0.55（target 0.70）。差距原因：\n    (1) simulation使用的是idealized independent administrations，但real temporal cohorts\n    have correlated composition（overlapping models between administrations）；(2) medium\n    effect size (δ=1.0) 在MMLU的high-noise环境下需要更多accumulation；(3) prior specification\n    N(0,1.5)可能too vague for the specific DIF magnitude distribution observed in MMLU。对于large\n    effects (δ≥1.4)，cumulative确实提升到0.82——但这些items 已经被single-admin MH-DIF以0.68 power检测到，marginal\n    value limited。结论：theoretically sound但实际improvement insufficient to justify methodological\n    complexity。simulation-only， underdeveloped，correctly moved to appendix。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Cumulative Bayesian Power by Effect Size'\n    columns:\n    - effect_delta\n    - admin_1\n    - admin_2\n    - admin_3\n    - admin_4\n    rows:\n    - - 0.8\n      - 0.22\n      - 0.3\n      - 0.36\n      - 0.41\n    - - 1.0\n      - 0.4\n      - 0.48\n      - 0.55\n      - 0.61\n    - - 1.4\n      - 0.68\n      - 0.75\n      - 0.82\n      - 0.87\n    - - 1.6\n      - 0.79\n      - 0.85\n      - 0.9\n      - 0.93\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Power curves for single vs cumulative (2,3,4) administrations as function\n    of effect size. Horizontal line at 0.70 target.'\n  analysis: 'Cumulative Bayesian DIF在median档下是\"promising but insufficient\"的结果。 对medium\n    effects改善不够，对large effects marginal。Appendix supplementary。 审稿人不会miss this——not\n    a required contribution。\n\n    '\n- name: graceful_degradation_analysis\n  plan_id: plan_008\n  description: '正式分析benchmark validity在progressive item replacement下的degradation。\n    5%, 10%, 20%, 50% replacement rates。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    rho_5pct_replacement: 0.9991\n    rho_10pct_replacement: 0.9982\n    rho_20pct_replacement: 0.9958\n    rho_31pct_replacement: 0.9935\n    rho_50pct_replacement: 0.987\n    shr_5pct: 0.998\n    shr_10pct: 0.996\n    shr_20pct: 0.993\n    shr_31pct: 0.989\n    shr_50pct: 0.975\n    construct_coverage_5pct: 0.99\n    construct_coverage_31pct: 0.94\n    construct_coverage_50pct: 0.86\n    bootstrap_ci_rho_31pct:\n    - 0.991\n    - 0.996\n    random_replacement_rho_31pct: 0.997\n    targeted_dif_replacement_rho_31pct: 0.993\n  result_rationale: 'median档下graceful degradation的core finding与actual plan_017一致（ρ>0.99\n    even at 31% removal），但CIs wider。关键区别：(1) random replacement ρ=0.997 vs targeted\n    DIF replacement ρ=0.993——DIF items carries slightly more ranking-relevant information\n    than random items， 但差异small；(2) construct coverage at 31% drops to 0.94——意味着6%的construct\n    coverage loss，审稿人会问这是否trivial；(3) at 50% replacement ρ=0.987仍高，confirming massive\n    redundancy。但median档下审稿人会argue：(a) replacement items的calibration quality 未经验证（plan_006\n    failed），所以degradation analysis假设perfect replacement是unrealistic； (b) construct\n    coverage loss of 6%在certain high-stakes contexts可能non-trivial。 结论：clean supplementary\n    result但不解决审稿人对replacement feasibility的concern。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Validity Degradation Under Progressive Replacement'\n    columns:\n    - replacement_pct\n    - spearman_rho\n    - shr\n    - construct_coverage\n    - ci_95_rho\n    rows:\n    - - 5\n      - 0.9991\n      - 0.998\n      - 0.99\n      - '[0.9988, 0.9994]'\n    - - 10\n      - 0.9982\n      - 0.996\n      - 0.98\n      - '[0.9976, 0.9988]'\n    - - 20\n      - 0.9958\n      - 0.993\n      - 0.96\n      - '[0.9945, 0.9971]'\n    - - 31\n      - 0.9935\n      - 0.989\n      - 0.94\n      - '[0.9910, 0.9960]'\n    - - 50\n      - 0.987\n      - 0.975\n      - 0.86\n      - '[0.9830, 0.9910]'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: ρ vs replacement rate curve. Gradual decline. Annotation at 31% showing\n    DIF-targeted vs random replacement comparison.'\n  analysis: 'Supports \"instability ≠ invalidity\" narrative。但在median档下，plan_006的failure意味着\n    practical replacement尚不可行，so this analysis是theoretical exercise。 Appendix supplementary，支持Claim\n    4的redundancy finding。\n\n    '\n- name: item_focused_trees\n  plan_id: plan_009\n  description: '实现Item-Focused Trees (Tutz & Berger 2016)。将model release date作为continuous\n    covariate， 避免arbitrary cohort splits。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_items_analyzed: 12508\n    ift_flagged_items_pct: 28.5\n    ift_dif_mh_jaccard: 0.72\n    ift_dif_mh_concordance: 0.78\n    ift_unique_flags_pct: 5.2\n    mh_unique_flags_pct: 7.8\n    ift_temporal_gradient:\n      pct_monotonic_increase: 35\n      pct_monotonic_decrease: 28\n      pct_nonlinear: 37\n    ift_split_points_mode: 2023-Q4 to 2024-Q1\n    computational_cost_ratio_vs_mh: 15\n  result_rationale: 'median档下IFT flags 28.5% items（vs MH的31.3%），Jaccard=0.72说明substantial\n    overlap但 不identical。IFT的added value：(1) 37% items显示nonlinear temporal pattern——DIF不是\n    monotonic drift而是有discontinuities，possibly reflecting specific model release waves；\n    (2) 自动发现的split point集中在2023-Q4到2024-Q1，与MH的手动temporal split一致， validating cohort定义；(3)\n    5.2% IFT-unique flags是MH missed的——these tend to be items with small-but-continuous\n    drift that doesn''t cross ETS C threshold。但IFT computational cost 15× MH，且37%\n    nonlinear patterns增加interpretation complexity。在median档下IFT是 clean robustness check\n    confirming MH findings are not artifact of arbitrary binary split， 但不改变core conclusions。审稿人appreciate\n    as supplementary validation。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: IFT vs MH-DIF Comparison'\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - IFT\n    - MH_DIF\n    rows:\n    - - flagged_pct\n      - 28.5\n      - 31.3\n    - - unique_flags_pct\n      - 5.2\n      - 7.8\n    - - overlap_jaccard\n      - 0.72\n      - 0.72\n    - - computational_cost_relative\n      - 15x\n      - 1x\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: IFT temporal gradient for 3 example items showing monotonic increase, monotonic\n    decrease, and nonlinear patterns.'\n  analysis: 'IFT validates MH cohort split choice。nonlinear patterns add nuance but\n    don''t change core finding。Appendix supplementary robustness check。\n\n    '\n- name: architecture_stratified_dif\n  plan_id: plan_010\n  description: '在decoder-only homogeneous subpopulation上运行DIF，检验architecture heterogeneity\n    是否inflates spurious DIF。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_decoder_only: 5222\n    n_non_decoder: 5\n    pct_decoder_only: 99.9\n    decoder_only_c_pct: 31.2\n    full_population_c_pct: 31.3\n    jaccard_decoder_only_vs_full: 0.998\n    irt_rmsea_full: 0.082\n    irt_rmsea_decoder_only: 0.081\n    irt_cfi_full: 0.72\n    irt_cfi_decoder_only: 0.72\n    lz_pct_above_2_full: 98.0\n    lz_pct_above_2_decoder_only: 97.8\n  result_rationale: 'METABENCH MMLU中99.90%是decoder-only（5222/5227，排除5个encoder-decoder/encoder-only），\n    所以architecture stratification几乎是no-op。C%从31.3%降至31.2%，Jaccard=0.998。 关键insight：IRT\n    fit metrics完全不改善（RMSEA=0.081 vs 0.082, CFI=0.72 vs 0.72）—— 这证明|Lz|>2的98% misfit不是由architecture\n    heterogeneity驱动，而是MMLU inherent multidimensionality (57 subjects forced into 1D)。在median档下，这个结果虽然是\n    \"architecture is a non-issue\"的强证据，但同时expose了一个更深的问题：如果IRT fit 在homogeneous population下仍然terrible，那么所有基于1D\n    IRT的DIF findings都建立在 misspecified model上。审稿人（at least one）会将98% |Lz|>2视为fundamental\n    concern， 要求pilot multidimensional analysis——这是median档的defining reviewer concern之一。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Architecture Stratification (Non-Issue Confirmation)'\n    columns:\n    - population\n    - N\n    - c_pct\n    - rmsea\n    - cfi\n    - lz_pct_gt2\n    rows:\n    - - full\n      - 5227\n      - 31.3\n      - 0.082\n      - 0.72\n      - 98.0\n    - - decoder_only\n      - 5222\n      - 31.2\n      - 0.081\n      - 0.72\n      - 97.8\n    - - delta\n      - -5\n      - -0.1\n      - -0.001\n      - 0.0\n      - -0.2\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: |Lz| distribution for full vs decoder-only populations. Nearly identical.\n    Vertical line at |Lz|=2 showing 98% exceed threshold in both.'\n  analysis: 'Architecture concern definitively resolved。但IRT misfit concern simultaneously\n    amplified——这在median档下成为审稿人要求pilot MIRT的trigger。plan_005的bifactor failure 意味着这个concern只能部分address（2-3\n    subject pilot），不能fully resolve。 在Discussion中需要explicit subsection \"IRT model misspecification\n    bounds on our findings\"。\n\n    '\n- name: semi_synthetic_contamination_validation\n  plan_id: plan_011\n  description: '在real METABENCH response matrix中注入known contamination，测量DIF detection\n    power。 Controlled ground truth避免Li et al. proxy label的circularity。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_clean_items: 500\n    n_injected_items: 150\n    temporal_external_tpr_p0: 0.31\n    temporal_external_tpr_p03: 0.45\n    temporal_external_tpr_p05: 0.68\n    temporal_external_tpr_p07: 0.88\n    temporal_external_tpr_p10: 0.97\n    temporal_external_fpr: 0.31\n    temporal_external_delta_tpr_p05: 0.37\n    temporal_external_delta_tpr_p10: 0.66\n    cross_subject_delta_fpr: 0.001\n    within_subject_fpr_inflation_p10: 0.19\n    matching_variable_contamination_confirmed: true\n    dose_response_monotonic: true\n    injection_prevalence_sensitivity:\n      pct_5_delta_tpr: 0.28\n      pct_10_delta_tpr: 0.33\n      pct_20_delta_tpr: 0.37\n      pct_30_delta_tpr: 0.4\n    exploitation_rate_sensitivity:\n      p_04_delta_tpr: 0.12\n      p_06_delta_tpr: 0.25\n      p_08_delta_tpr: 0.45\n      p_10_delta_tpr: 0.66\n  result_rationale: 'median档下semi-synthetic ΔTPR at p=0.5 = 0.37（在0.35-0.50 range内），低于actual的\n    0.508(p=0.5)和0.674(p=1.0)。原因：(1) elevated baseline FPR=0.31意味着许多genuine DIF items\n    已经被flagged在p=0（no injection），leaving less room for TPR increase on injected items；\n    (2) at exploitation rate p=0.5，每个injected item仅50%概率flip incorrect→correct， effective\n    DIF magnitude较小——power analysis预期δ≈0.8，落在operational region边缘 （N≥80但δ<1.4）；(3)\n    cross-subject matching ΔFPR=0.001是强正面结果——matching variable contamination完全isolated，confirming\n    cross-subject matching是sound methodology； (4) within-subject matching FPR inflation\n    +0.19 confirms the contaminated-matching-variable problem。dose-response monotonic是clean结果。在median档下审稿人acknowledge\n    ΔTPR>0 is significant但0.37 at p=0.5 is \"moderate power\"——semi-synthetic framework的value更多是\n    methodology本身（reusable infrastructure）而非specific power numbers。这支持Claim 3作为 primary\n    contribution的repositioning。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Semi-Synthetic Detection Power (Cross-Subject Matching)'\n    columns:\n    - exploitation_rate_p\n    - tpr\n    - fpr\n    - delta_tpr\n    - delta_fpr\n    rows:\n    - - 0.0_baseline\n      - 0.31\n      - 0.31\n      - 0.0\n      - 0.0\n    - - 0.3\n      - 0.45\n      - 0.31\n      - 0.14\n      - 0.001\n    - - 0.5\n      - 0.68\n      - 0.31\n      - 0.37\n      - 0.001\n    - - 0.7\n      - 0.88\n      - 0.31\n      - 0.57\n      - 0.001\n    - - 1.0\n      - 0.97\n      - 0.31\n      - 0.66\n      - 0.001\n  - name: 'Table: Within-Subject vs Cross-Subject Matching FPR'\n    columns:\n    - matching_method\n    - fpr_baseline\n    - fpr_p10\n    - delta_fpr\n    rows:\n    - - within_subject\n      - 0.31\n      - 0.5\n      - 0.19\n    - - cross_subject\n      - 0.31\n      - 0.311\n      - 0.001\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Dose-response curve (ΔTPR vs exploitation rate p). Cross-subject matching\n    (solid) vs within-subject (dashed). FPR inflation band for within-subject visible.'\n  - 'Fig: ΔFPR across injection prevalence rates for cross-subject matching. Flat\n    at ~0.001, confirming isolation.'\n  analysis: 'Semi-synthetic framework是median档下最强contribution。ΔTPR=0.37 at p=0.5 is\n    moderate but positive, dose-response is clean, cross-subject matching ΔFPR≈0 is\n    the key methodological innovation。升级为primary contribution。审稿人在novelty score上 给2.5-3.5但acknowledge\n    framework reusability。\n\n    '\n- name: multi_benchmark_temporal_dif\n  plan_id: plan_028\n  description: '在METABENCH中的additional benchmarks (ARC, HellaSwag, WinoGrande, TruthfulQA)上\n    运行temporal DIF，检验跨benchmark generalizability。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    mmlu_c_pct: 31.3\n    arc_c_pct: 22.5\n    hellaswag_c_pct: 14.8\n    winogrande_c_pct: 26.1\n    truthfulqa_c_pct: 25.3\n    gsm8k_c_pct: 15.2\n    cross_benchmark_range: 14.8-31.3%\n    cross_benchmark_min: 14.8\n    cross_benchmark_max: 31.3\n    all_above_random_control: true\n    random_control_max: 0.55\n    min_enrichment_ratio: 27\n    benchmarks_above_15pct: 5\n    benchmarks_above_20pct: 4\n    benchmarks_above_25pct: 3\n    arc_random_c_pct: 0.5\n    hellaswag_random_c_pct: 0.22\n    winogrande_random_c_pct: 0.35\n    truthfulqa_random_c_pct: 0.4\n  result_rationale: 'median档下cross-benchmark C% range为14.8-31.3%（在12-18% min, 28-32%\n    max range内）。 HellaSwag最低(14.8%)因为：(1) commonsense reasoning items更homogeneous，temporal\n    drift 较小；(2) 10042 items中许多是pattern-matching tasks，less susceptible to differential\n    functioning across model generations。MMLU最高(31.3%)因为57 subjects的heterogeneity\n    创造了更多DIF opportunity。ARC/WinoGrande/TruthfulQA在22-26%范围内。关键observation： 所有6个benchmarks的C%都远高于random\n    control (<0.6%)，enrichment ratio≥27，所以temporal DIF is pervasive。但median档下HellaSwag的14.8%略低于15%\n    \"flag\" threshold（audit protocol three-tier中<15 = monitor only），这给了审稿人一个talking\n    point：\"not all benchmarks reach concerning levels\"。需要honest报告：4/6 benchmarks above\n    20%，2/6 below 20%。 Cross-benchmark generalizability is \"substantial but variable\"而非\"universal\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Multi-Benchmark Temporal DIF (2023 vs 2024)'\n    columns:\n    - benchmark\n    - n_items\n    - n_ref\n    - n_foc\n    - c_pct\n    - random_c_pct\n    - enrichment_ratio\n    - audit_tier\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU\n      - 12508\n      - 1080\n      - 807\n      - 31.3\n      - 0.18\n      - 174\n      - act\n    - - WinoGrande\n      - 1267\n      - 1017\n      - 803\n      - 26.1\n      - 0.35\n      - 75\n      - flag\n    - - TruthfulQA\n      - 817\n      - 1080\n      - 807\n      - 25.3\n      - 0.4\n      - 63\n      - flag\n    - - ARC\n      - 1172\n      - 1080\n      - 807\n      - 22.5\n      - 0.5\n      - 45\n      - flag\n    - - GSM8K\n      - 1319\n      - 1017\n      - 804\n      - 15.2\n      - 0.25\n      - 61\n      - flag\n    - - HellaSwag\n      - 10042\n      - 1080\n      - 807\n      - 14.8\n      - 0.22\n      - 67\n      - monitor\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Bar chart of C% by benchmark with random control overlay. All bars far exceed\n    random. Horizontal lines at 15% (monitor) and 25% (flag) thresholds.'\n  analysis: 'Multi-benchmark DIF strengthens generalizability claim但reveals variability。\n    median档下HellaSwag < 15%给审稿人ammunition。framing应为\"temporal measurement drift is\n    a general phenomenon across LLM benchmarks (all >> random), with benchmark-specific\n    magnitude reflecting task and item characteristics\"。honest reporting of range。\n\n    '\n- name: permutation_null_c_rate\n  plan_id: plan_029\n  description: '1000× permutation test: 随机reassign temporal labels，建立C%的null distribution。\n    回答\"31% is above chance?\"\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_permutations: 1000\n    null_c_pct_mean: 5.2\n    null_c_pct_sd: 0.8\n    null_c_pct_95th_percentile: 6.5\n    null_c_pct_99th_percentile: 7.3\n    null_c_pct_max: 8.1\n    observed_c_pct: 31.3\n    permutation_p_value: <0.001\n    z_score_observed_vs_null: 32.6\n    excess_c_pct: 26.1\n    within_cohort_random_split_c_pct: 0.18\n    ratio_permutation_null_to_random_split: 28.9\n  result_rationale: 'median档下permutation null C%=5.2%（在3-8% range内），远高于within-cohort\n    random split 的0.18%但远低于observed 31.3%。5.2% null rate意味着：(1) temporal labels本身携带non-DIF\n    signal——当你随机shuffe 2023/2024 labels时，模型composition的statistical properties (ability\n    distribution, family structure, training recipe distribution) 被破坏，但残留的 correlations\n    between temporal label和model characteristics仍然产生~5% spurious DIF； (2) 这不是type-I\n    error——permutation test正确preserve了model-level dependencies， 5.2%反映的是temporal label作为proxy\n    for multiple confounds的composite effect； (3) observed 31.3%仍以z=32.6 highly significant\n    (p<0.001)，excess=26.1%是genuine。 但审稿人会argue：(a) 5.2% null不trivial，说明temporal labels不是clean\n    experimental manipulation；(b) permutation test只controls for label assignment，不controls\n    for systematic differences in cohort composition（ability, training data vintage等）——\n    plan_027的ability matching只addresses one such confound；(c) 真正的\"after all controls\"\n    estimate可能需要subtract更多confounds。median档下effective C%=24.5%（31.3% - 5.2% null -\n    2.4pp ability - ~1pp other adjustments ≈ 22-25%）。审稿人接受这是significant但 要求更careful\n    attribution。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Permutation Null Distribution'\n    columns:\n    - statistic\n    - value\n    rows:\n    - - null_mean_c_pct\n      - 5.2\n    - - null_sd\n      - 0.8\n    - - null_95th_percentile\n      - 6.5\n    - - null_99th_percentile\n      - 7.3\n    - - null_max\n      - 8.1\n    - - observed_c_pct\n      - 31.3\n    - - excess_over_null_mean\n      - 26.1\n    - - z_score\n      - 32.6\n    - - permutation_p\n      - <0.001\n    - - within_cohort_random_c_pct\n      - 0.18\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Histogram of 1000 permutation null C% values (mean=5.2%, tight distribution).\n    Vertical red line at observed 31.3%. Massive separation. Inset shows null distribution\n    detail.'\n  analysis: 'Permutation null是median档的defining result。5.2%建立了proper baseline——31.3%仍highly\n    significant但需要honest报告excess=~26%而非31%。审稿人一的concern不是significance 而是interpretation：\"what\n    does the 5.2% null represent?\" 这需要explicit discussion of temporal label as composite\n    proxy for multiple factors (ability, training data, architecture evolution, RLHF\n    practices)。median档下这个5.2%成为\"conservative controls\" narrative的anchor point。\n\n    '\n- name: odds_ratio_regression_transparency\n  plan_id: plan_030\n  description: '补充odds ratio + 95% CI + McFadden/Nagelkerke R² + deviance ratio。 Item-level\n    accuracy change作为finer-grained predictor。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    model1_domain_delta:\n      mcfadden_r2: 0.0007\n      nagelkerke_r2: 0.0012\n      subject_acc_delta_or_per_010: 1.55\n      subject_acc_delta_ci_per_010:\n      - 1.19\n      - 2.03\n    model2_domain_delta_plus_items:\n      mcfadden_r2: 0.042\n      nagelkerke_r2: 0.071\n      ctt_difficulty_or_per_010: 0.78\n      ctt_discrimination_or_per_010: 1.51\n    model3_item_delta:\n      mcfadden_r2: 0.0012\n      nagelkerke_r2: 0.0021\n      item_acc_change_or_per_010: 1.08\n      item_acc_change_ci:\n      - 1.02\n      - 1.14\n    model4_item_delta_plus_items:\n      mcfadden_r2: 0.043\n      nagelkerke_r2: 0.073\n      simpsons_paradox: true\n    lr_test_m1_vs_m2_chi2: 645\n    lr_test_m3_vs_m4_chi2: 653\n    best_model_r2: 0.073\n    deviance_explained_pct: 7.3\n  result_rationale: 'median档下odds ratio regression结果与actual一致——这是deterministic statistical\n    analysis on fixed data。McFadden R²=0.0007 (domain-level predictor alone) confirms\n    domain improvement explains essentially nothing at item level。Model 4 (item Δ\n    + item props) 的Nagelkerke R²=0.073意味着所有可观测predictors combined仅解释7.3%的DIF variance——\n    92.7%是unexplained，supporting \"instability is predominantly item-specific\"。 Simpson''s\n    paradox在Model 2→4 transition中再现：item accuracy change OR从1.55 (positive, Model\n    1)翻转为0.92 (negative, Model 4) when item properties are controlled——说明 difficulty和discrimination是confounders。在median档下审稿人accept这作为thorough\n    transparency analysis但会note：(1) 7.3% total R² means our understanding of DIF drivers\n    is very limited; (2) unmeasured item-level confounds (topic specificity, question\n    format, cognitive level) might explain more; (3) Simpson''s paradox means Model\n    1 should NOT be used for causal interpretation。paper应使用Model 1 as primary (descriptive)\n    with Model 4 as supplementary (adjusted)。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Logistic Regression Models for DIF Prediction'\n    columns:\n    - model\n    - predictors\n    - mcfadden_r2\n    - nagelkerke_r2\n    - aic\n    - key_or\n    rows:\n    - - M1\n      - domain_acc_delta\n      - 0.0007\n      - 0.0012\n      - 15545\n      - 1.55 per 0.10\n    - - M2\n      - M1 + item_props\n      - 0.042\n      - 0.071\n      - 14902\n      - difficulty 0.78, disc 1.51\n    - - M3\n      - item_acc_delta\n      - 0.0012\n      - 0.0021\n      - 15537\n      - 1.08 per 0.10\n    - - M4\n      - M3 + item_props\n      - 0.043\n      - 0.073\n      - 14885\n      - acc_Δ 0.92 (reversed)\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Forest plot of ORs (per 0.10 unit) across 4 models. Simpson''s paradox highlighted:\n    acc_delta OR flips from >1 to <1 when item properties are added.'\n  analysis: Odds ratio transparency analysis是clean supplementary work。confirms <8%\n    variance explained。在median档下审稿人appreciate transparency but note limited explanatory\n    power as a gap. Simpson's paradox需要explicit discussion as a caution for interpretation.\n","numLines":1211,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1211}}}
